(1486062, 196171, 37961, '<td valign="top">This really appeals to my eye and is certainly in keeping with the challenge. I love it. Voting High.</td>', 'This really appeals to my eye and is certainly in keeping with the challenge. I love it. Voting High.', '2005-06-27 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486065, 195285, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. The gravel in focus, very well done. Bump High! Top 3 IMO.</td>', 'This is wonderful. The gravel in focus, very well done. Bump High! Top 3 IMO.', '2005-06-27 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486070, 196236, 37961, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and colorful. I love it.</td>', 'Very abstract and colorful. I love it.', '2005-06-27 10:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486083, 196339, 38275, '<td valign="top">I like this pic. I like the way you caught the glitter of the sand. I also love the castle.</td>', 'I like this pic. I like the way you caught the glitter of the sand. I also love the castle.', '2005-06-27 11:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486101, 196180, 30791, '<td valign="top">this is cool, i would have given it an 7 but the bricks are washed out</td>', 'this is cool, i would have given it an 7 but the bricks are washed out', '2005-06-27 11:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486102, 196347, 34192, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites.  Love how the background fades away, giving the image even more depth.  Tones, lighting, POV, DOF all great for me.  10 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'one of my favorites.  Love how the background fades away, giving the image even more depth.  Tones, lighting, POV, DOF all great for me.  10 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-27 11:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486104, 196011, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Absolutely beautiful.  The tones used convey the emptiness.  Solitude.  POV, DOF, focus - everything well done.  10 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow!  Absolutely beautiful.  The tones used convey the emptiness.  Solitude.  POV, DOF, focus - everything well done.  10 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-27 11:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486105, 195282, 34192, '<td valign="top">love the colors.  Love the simplicity.  Looks like a painting.  8 from me - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'love the colors.  Love the simplicity.  Looks like a painting.  8 from me - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-27 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486107, 196219, 36353, '<td valign="top">This shot rocks! I would love to see the guy moved a bit closer for better detail and a bit off center. The color of this is great. The back wall looks crooked, if you could straighten that, this shot would be great. Very photojournalistic.<br/> <br/>Despite these little differences in technical opinion, you have succeeded in forcing me to have an emotive response to your image, and it quite obviously fits within the confines on the challenge. SUCCESS!!!</td>', 'This shot rocks! I would love to see the guy moved a bit closer for better detail and a bit off center. The color of this is great. The back wall looks crooked, if you could straighten that, this shot would be great. Very photojournalistic. Despite these little differences in technical opinion, you have succeeded in forcing me to have an emotive response to your image, and it quite obviously fits within the confines on the challenge. SUCCESS!!!', '2005-06-27 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486115, 194321, 38248, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!  I like it.</td>', 'Great idea!!  I like it.', '2005-06-27 11:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486117, 196326, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality. It''s very intriguing.</td>', 'Excellent quality. It''s very intriguing.', '2005-06-27 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486118, 196321, 39144, '<td valign="top">The butterfly needs more focus I think.</td>', 'The butterfly needs more focus I think.', '2005-06-27 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486119, 196279, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like how the cursive live moves the eye through the pic.  seems a bit over saturated.  the spirder web? is a bit distracting.  wish there was something to counterbalance the brightness of the main cloud</td>', 'i like how the cursive live moves the eye through the pic.  seems a bit over saturated.  the spirder web? is a bit distracting.  wish there was something to counterbalance the brightness of the main cloud', '2005-06-27 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486120, 196297, 13688, '<td valign="top">excellent focus. cool feeling you''ve evoked of trying  to hang on from falling off of the hillside.   the more i look at it the more i like it, though purists might not be so kind.</td>', 'excellent focus. cool feeling you''ve evoked of trying  to hang on from falling off of the hillside.   the more i look at it the more i like it, though purists might not be so kind.', '2005-06-27 11:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486122, 196403, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice choice to go b/w.  I wish you had come up with a way to show less of the grass foreground</td>', 'nice choice to go b/w.  I wish you had come up with a way to show less of the grass foreground', '2005-06-27 11:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486123, 196365, 34759, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the power line (?) near the top is a bit distracting. It would have improved the shot if you had cropped enough off the top to get rid of it.</td>', 'Pretty, but the power line (?) near the top is a bit distracting. It would have improved the shot if you had cropped enough off the top to get rid of it.', '2005-06-27 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486128, 195954, 13688, '<td valign="top">good leading line.  I''m a bit uncomfortable with the right side of the warf not being in the bottom righ of the pict. kind of like cutting off a human''s limb.   i guess this would have prevented you from getting the beach.  perhaps an alternative would be to shoot down on the beach looking up at the jetty</td>', 'good leading line.  I''m a bit uncomfortable with the right side of the warf not being in the bottom righ of the pict. kind of like cutting off a human''s limb.   i guess this would have prevented you from getting the beach.  perhaps an alternative would be to shoot down on the beach looking up at the jetty', '2005-06-27 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486132, 195591, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like how the tree also leads the eye back down to the water.  nice composition.  i would have  liked to seen you underexpose it a lot more to help out the sky</td>', 'i really like how the tree also leads the eye back down to the water.  nice composition.  i would have  liked to seen you underexpose it a lot more to help out the sky', '2005-06-27 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486136, 196073, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice abstract.  wish the sky was a deeper blue.  the light on structure seems to not coincide with your focal point.  maybe some burning and dodging so it''s easier on the eye to get to the tip...sorry i''m being picky.  maybe a bit more room after the tip would help as well...sorry now i''m being really picky...i''ll stop now.</td>', 'nice abstract.  wish the sky was a deeper blue.  the light on structure seems to not coincide with your focal point.  maybe some burning and dodging so it''s easier on the eye to get to the tip...sorry i''m being picky.  maybe a bit more room after the tip would help as well...sorry now i''m being really picky...i''ll stop now.', '2005-06-27 11:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486137, 196161, 13688, '<td valign="top">great lines.  i''m wondering if this would look even cooler from farther back or with a wider lense...if possible.  I think you need some more contrast and a hue adjustment</td>', 'great lines.  i''m wondering if this would look even cooler from farther back or with a wider lense...if possible.  I think you need some more contrast and a hue adjustment', '2005-06-27 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486141, 196010, 13688, '<td valign="top">try not to sell your self short, especially in the title :)  you''ve got a lot of  available lines in this structure...next time try to think more abstractly.  from what i see available i would have liked to see something done with just the chains and that handrail.  get close and focus tight so the distracting elements of the background are blurred.</td>', 'try not to sell your self short, especially in the title :)  you''ve got a lot of  available lines in this structure...next time try to think more abstractly.  from what i see available i would have liked to see something done with just the chains and that handrail.  get close and focus tight so the distracting elements of the background are blurred.', '2005-06-27 12:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486152, 196057, 13688, '<td valign="top">good idea, but maybe the composition could have been bettered served without trying to get such a magnified shot which isn''t this particular lense''s strong suit.  maybe instead of lines on the zebra , which i''m finding lead the eye away from your focal point, down to the bottom right anyway, you could have found lines leading the eye to the zebra(s).  that adds  even more irony.  just some thoughts.</td>', 'good idea, but maybe the composition could have been bettered served without trying to get such a magnified shot which isn''t this particular lense''s strong suit.  maybe instead of lines on the zebra , which i''m finding lead the eye away from your focal point, down to the bottom right anyway, you could have found lines leading the eye to the zebra(s).  that adds  even more irony.  just some thoughts.', '2005-06-27 12:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486165, 196210, 2223, '<td valign="top">Oooooo, I love it! Beautiful bold colors! Big 10 from me!</td>', 'Oooooo, I love it! Beautiful bold colors! Big 10 from me!', '2005-06-27 12:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486169, 196108, 37234, '<td valign="top">Well done b&amp;w. Great use of theme</td>', 'Well done b&w. Great use of theme', '2005-06-27 12:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486171, 196058, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and clarity of the lines.  I don''t much care for the crop though.  Perhaps even too close and centered?</td>', 'Very nice detail and clarity of the lines.  I don''t much care for the crop though.  Perhaps even too close and centered?', '2005-06-27 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486177, 195401, 3669, '<td valign="top">The sky is beautiful in this picture, however the foreground seems a little over sharpened to me.</td>', 'The sky is beautiful in this picture, however the foreground seems a little over sharpened to me.', '2005-06-27 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486183, 196264, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice sky.<br/>but the foreground seems a little too dark.</td>', 'nice sky.but the foreground seems a little too dark.', '2005-06-27 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486185, 195531, 18219, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-06-27 12:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486186, 196385, 2223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work! 9</td>', 'Beautiful work! 9', '2005-06-27 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486189, 195902, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice black and white picture.<br/>but the only "leading line" I can see is the one on the road?<br/>And that in iself isn''t very interesting!!!!!<br/>But a good picture none the less</td>', 'nice black and white picture.but the only "leading line" I can see is the one on the road?And that in iself isn''t very interesting!!!!!But a good picture none the less', '2005-06-27 12:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
