(1486675, 196224, 3669, '<td valign="top">I know the path is intended to be your leading line and that is nice, however, I don''t really care for this angle for the monument.  The position of the sun shines directly on it and overexposes it, therefore it looks like just a blob of bright white.  You have nice clouds, though, so I think if the monument wasn''t there, it would be a very nice picture.  6</td>', 'I know the path is intended to be your leading line and that is nice, however, I don''t really care for this angle for the monument.  The position of the sun shines directly on it and overexposes it, therefore it looks like just a blob of bright white.  You have nice clouds, though, so I think if the monument wasn''t there, it would be a very nice picture.  6', '2005-06-27 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
