(1486714, 196234, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and full image.  Many things going on.  This is one of those images you could look at for a long time and still not notice everything.  However, I don''t see leading lines as the compositional technique in this image.</td>', 'Very colorful and full image.  Many things going on.  This is one of those images you could look at for a long time and still not notice everything.  However, I don''t see leading lines as the compositional technique in this image.', '2005-06-27 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
