(1486717, 195229, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and vibrant colors. I wish you took this photo straight on so it''s a flat elevation as opposed to at an angle.</td>', 'Nice composition and vibrant colors. I wish you took this photo straight on so it''s a flat elevation as opposed to at an angle.', '2005-06-27 16:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486719, 195763, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl, perfect colored dress.  Not sure why you angled the image - kind of awkward.   Focus, DOV, POV are all great.   Her feet are cut off.</td>', 'Pretty girl, perfect colored dress.  Not sure why you angled the image - kind of awkward.   Focus, DOV, POV are all great.   Her feet are cut off.', '2005-06-27 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486721, 195903, 34192, '<td valign="top">You have a leading line but the point the line leads you to is out of focus, leaving me to wonder why I was led there.  Interesting take on the challenge!</td>', 'You have a leading line but the point the line leads you to is out of focus, leaving me to wonder why I was led there.  Interesting take on the challenge!', '2005-06-27 16:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486722, 195993, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this image may look better in sepia.  No clue why, just a thought.  The vertical trees cut off at the top lead me out of the image.  The slanted horizontal line does also.  You really want people led THROUGH an image, or to a point that is the main focus of the image.</td>', 'I think this image may look better in sepia.  No clue why, just a thought.  The vertical trees cut off at the top lead me out of the image.  The slanted horizontal line does also.  You really want people led THROUGH an image, or to a point that is the main focus of the image.', '2005-06-27 16:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486723, 195229, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition and lighting of a somewhat simple subject.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice color, composition and lighting of a somewhat simple subject.  Good job.', '2005-06-27 16:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486724, 194137, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting cloud formation.  Great colors and contrast.  I honestly don''t see leading lines as the compositional technique in this image.</td>', 'Interesting cloud formation.  Great colors and contrast.  I honestly don''t see leading lines as the compositional technique in this image.', '2005-06-27 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486726, 196131, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  The focus here seems to be more on the leaves than the trunk.  I don''t see leading lines as a strong compositional element here.  The trunk is a line but its leading me right out of the image.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  The focus here seems to be more on the leaves than the trunk.  I don''t see leading lines as a strong compositional element here.  The trunk is a line but its leading me right out of the image.', '2005-06-27 16:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486728, 195685, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very majestic.  Love the muted colors and composition.  The footprints in the sand add a nice touch.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Good Luck  10</td>', 'Very majestic.  Love the muted colors and composition.  The footprints in the sand add a nice touch.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Good Luck  10', '2005-06-27 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486730, 195511, 327, '<td valign="top">sweet ride.</td>', 'sweet ride.', '2005-06-27 16:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486732, 195902, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great image with great tones but a tenuous link to the challenge.</td>', 'Great image with great tones but a tenuous link to the challenge.', '2005-06-27 16:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486734, 195710, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  The composition is great and the colors are fantastic.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  10</td>', 'Very nicely done.  The composition is great and the colors are fantastic.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  10', '2005-06-27 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1486735, 195139, 34192, '<td valign="top">toungue in cheek?  Could be used to teach people what a leading line is. Lighting a little hardsh, DOF, POV excellent.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'toungue in cheek?  Could be used to teach people what a leading line is. Lighting a little hardsh, DOF, POV excellent.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-27 16:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
