(1487084, 195679, 13688, '<td valign="top">good leading line.  it''s shadow is a bit distracting.  i''m wondering if you could have improved the look and lessening of the shadow by centering the pier. the rule of thirds would still apply to the focus point.  another possible adjustment to make it easier on the eye might be to lower your point of view so the end of the pier merges with the horizon</td>', 'good leading line.  it''s shadow is a bit distracting.  i''m wondering if you could have improved the look and lessening of the shadow by centering the pier. the rule of thirds would still apply to the focus point.  another possible adjustment to make it easier on the eye might be to lower your point of view so the end of the pier merges with the horizon', '2005-06-27 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487090, 196269, 13688, '<td valign="top">clever idea, good focus.  the composition just feels a bit to chaotic to be able to make it fully work.</td>', 'clever idea, good focus.  the composition just feels a bit to chaotic to be able to make it fully work.', '2005-06-27 19:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487096, 194315, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like when i get an emotion from a pic.  this one really makes me uneasy, not just the gun, but the close range shot like you''re placing it up against someone''s head.  the mixed signal provided by the coke can is extremely intriguing.  I would have thought the more natural target to be a bud can. but upon further reflection  the feeling of a caffeen overdose adds to the tension.  very interesting, though i wouldn''t hang it on my wall.</td>', 'i like when i get an emotion from a pic.  this one really makes me uneasy, not just the gun, but the close range shot like you''re placing it up against someone''s head.  the mixed signal provided by the coke can is extremely intriguing.  I would have thought the more natural target to be a bud can. but upon further reflection  the feeling of a caffeen overdose adds to the tension.  very interesting, though i wouldn''t hang it on my wall.', '2005-06-27 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487102, 194910, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting subject, good lighting on the hat.  the blue cloth is a bit distracting in front. i''m not sure if the line you chose was the best option.  i''m thinking looking at the hat straight on down the u shape of the brim, very close up might prove to be more interesting and lead the eye into the pic better.</td>', 'interesting subject, good lighting on the hat.  the blue cloth is a bit distracting in front. i''m not sure if the line you chose was the best option.  i''m thinking looking at the hat straight on down the u shape of the brim, very close up might prove to be more interesting and lead the eye into the pic better.', '2005-06-27 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487104, 196385, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice processing.  very dreamlike.   i''d clone out the leg in the front row.</td>', 'nice processing.  very dreamlike.   i''d clone out the leg in the front row.', '2005-06-27 20:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
