(1487145, 195096, 13688, '<td valign="top">clever idea.  tough break on the blown out shirt, as it''s kind of distracting.  composition if controllable, i would have gone with her arm out of the pic and his popicle arm up more to match hers.  colors are very nice</td>', 'clever idea.  tough break on the blown out shirt, as it''s kind of distracting.  composition if controllable, i would have gone with her arm out of the pic and his popicle arm up more to match hers.  colors are very nice', '2005-06-27 20:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
