(1487337, 195839, 16829, '<td valign="top">Hard to make a shot like this interesting to anyone but the photographer. I think you succeeded. I like the subtle tones of blue and grey lightening as the eye rises. You caught a vey nice perspective on the converging lines.</td>', 'Hard to make a shot like this interesting to anyone but the photographer. I think you succeeded. I like the subtle tones of blue and grey lightening as the eye rises. You caught a vey nice perspective on the converging lines.', '2005-06-27 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487339, 196169, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Some will quibble about the overblown highlights in front of the girl, and others about the intrusive tree branch, but it''s nevertheless a very effective interpretation of the challenge topic.  7</td>', 'Lovely image.  Some will quibble about the overblown highlights in front of the girl, and others about the intrusive tree branch, but it''s nevertheless a very effective interpretation of the challenge topic.  7', '2005-06-27 22:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487345, 195597, 38997, '<td valign="top">very cool! i hope this train wasnt headed towards you! the perspective is great</td>', 'very cool! i hope this train wasnt headed towards you! the perspective is great', '2005-06-27 22:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487349, 196312, 39839, '<td valign="top">The picture is absolutely amazing.  I love the contrast of white and blue.  The leaves look like ice, beautiful.  Just don''t see how it connects with lines.</td>', 'The picture is absolutely amazing.  I love the contrast of white and blue.  The leaves look like ice, beautiful.  Just don''t see how it connects with lines.', '2005-06-27 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487351, 196170, 38592, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one of my top picks.  The curves definitely grab the viewers attention and although the lines don''t really lead to anything too interesting, I still think it works well.</td>', 'This is definitely one of my top picks.  The curves definitely grab the viewers attention and although the lines don''t really lead to anything too interesting, I still think it works well.', '2005-06-27 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487367, 196379, 36238, '<td valign="top">The sea spray is a bit disruptive to the photo, but I love the lines leading to the open sea in the far background.</td>', 'The sea spray is a bit disruptive to the photo, but I love the lines leading to the open sea in the far background.', '2005-06-27 22:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487393, 196347, 35739, '<td valign="top">Is this our dinner or their dinner?</td>', 'Is this our dinner or their dinner?', '2005-06-27 22:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487400, 196102, 38592, '<td valign="top">This is a gerat shot and I''m sure that it will do very well.  The only thing that prevented me from giving it a 10 was that I wish the subject (the man) was a little more clearly defined.  Still a very nice pic though.</td>', 'This is a gerat shot and I''m sure that it will do very well.  The only thing that prevented me from giving it a 10 was that I wish the subject (the man) was a little more clearly defined.  Still a very nice pic though.', '2005-06-27 22:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487402, 196428, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge.  Nice photo.', '2005-06-27 22:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487407, 196055, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent symmetry... it would be nicer if the woman was farther down the corridor.</td>', 'Excellent symmetry... it would be nicer if the woman was farther down the corridor.', '2005-06-27 22:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
