(1487425, 196224, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2005-06-27 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487447, 194046, 18677, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, fits the challenge well.  I''d like to give this an 8 but it''s too oversharpened.  Still a good shot though. (6)</td>', 'Very nice composition, fits the challenge well.  I''d like to give this an 8 but it''s too oversharpened.  Still a good shot though. (6)', '2005-06-27 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487451, 196297, 18677, '<td valign="top">Very unique composition.  It works here.  Great colors. (8)</td>', 'Very unique composition.  It works here.  Great colors. (8)', '2005-06-27 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487453, 196206, 18677, '<td valign="top">Very soft.  I''m not sure if it''s because of your camera, lens, or focus.  This would look very nice if shot later in the day, but the lighting here is too harsh. (5)</td>', 'Very soft.  I''m not sure if it''s because of your camera, lens, or focus.  This would look very nice if shot later in the day, but the lighting here is too harsh. (5)', '2005-06-27 23:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487456, 195704, 18677, '<td valign="top">VERY nice composition.  Good colors.  Very sharp.. maybe a little too sharp in a few spots.  I expect to see this one in the top 10. (8)</td>', 'VERY nice composition.  Good colors.  Very sharp.. maybe a little too sharp in a few spots.  I expect to see this one in the top 10. (8)', '2005-06-27 23:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487458, 195804, 18677, '<td valign="top">The standing block in front of the "3" is out of focus, which bugs me a lot when I look at this.  The cyan color on it doesn''t look so good with the green grass in the background -- that could''ve been changed in photoshop.  It''s a nice photo, but there''s just nothing too interesting about it. (5)</td>', 'The standing block in front of the "3" is out of focus, which bugs me a lot when I look at this.  The cyan color on it doesn''t look so good with the green grass in the background -- that could''ve been changed in photoshop.  It''s a nice photo, but there''s just nothing too interesting about it. (5)', '2005-06-27 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487462, 196338, 18677, '<td valign="top">The composition (particularly of the rocks) looks a slight bit snapshotish, but I really like the waterfall in the background, even though it is a little overexposed.  The colors are god.  The sharpness of the trees is very good considering this must have been a relatively long exposure.</td>', 'The composition (particularly of the rocks) looks a slight bit snapshotish, but I really like the waterfall in the background, even though it is a little overexposed.  The colors are god.  The sharpness of the trees is very good considering this must have been a relatively long exposure.', '2005-06-27 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487465, 196177, 18677, '<td valign="top">This is very mean and maybe a little over the top, but the sharpness is wonderful and the focus &amp; DOF are excellent.  I don''t mind that the white shirts are overexposed.  Good contrast.</td>', 'This is very mean and maybe a little over the top, but the sharpness is wonderful and the focus & DOF are excellent.  I don''t mind that the white shirts are overexposed.  Good contrast.', '2005-06-27 23:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487467, 196161, 18677, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture.  I like it.  The colors seem a little flat.  A polarizer might''ve helped, or maybe shooting a slight bit later in the day.</td>', 'Very interesting picture.  I like it.  The colors seem a little flat.  A polarizer might''ve helped, or maybe shooting a slight bit later in the day.', '2005-06-27 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487468, 196402, 18677, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be in the wrong place, but the composition is pretty good.</td>', 'Focus seems to be in the wrong place, but the composition is pretty good.', '2005-06-27 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487481, 196234, 31534, '<td valign="top">there is so much going on in this picture that the path is not working to lead the eyes.</td>', 'there is so much going on in this picture that the path is not working to lead the eyes.', '2005-06-27 23:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487492, 196443, 39106, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... this bridge looks familiar. nice shot.</td>', 'Hmmmm... this bridge looks familiar. nice shot.', '2005-06-27 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487494, 195828, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice story. 7</td>', 'nice story. 7', '2005-06-27 23:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487498, 196277, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice perspective and composition. Color tone is great for my eyes. I''d wish for a tad more contrast. 8</td>', 'nice perspective and composition. Color tone is great for my eyes. I''d wish for a tad more contrast. 8', '2005-06-27 23:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487500, 196358, 34247, '<td valign="top">freaky invert. nice macro and detailing. the shadows/details on the drop is great. 8</td>', 'freaky invert. nice macro and detailing. the shadows/details on the drop is great. 8', '2005-06-27 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487502, 196177, 34247, '<td valign="top">funny shot. the cigarettes aren''t lit though, and for the imagery to fully work, I think that''s a detail that needed to have been taken care of. the playfullness of the story is there, the shoes on the girls are great details. the dof is very nice as well. 7</td>', 'funny shot. the cigarettes aren''t lit though, and for the imagery to fully work, I think that''s a detail that needed to have been taken care of. the playfullness of the story is there, the shoes on the girls are great details. the dof is very nice as well. 7', '2005-06-27 23:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487503, 196389, 34247, '<td valign="top">i find this shot generally too dark. 5</td>', 'i find this shot generally too dark. 5', '2005-06-27 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487504, 195623, 34247, '<td valign="top">beautiful toning and perspective. 8</td>', 'beautiful toning and perspective. 8', '2005-06-27 23:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487507, 196443, 34247, '<td valign="top">awesome composition. 7</td>', 'awesome composition. 7', '2005-06-27 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487508, 195710, 34247, '<td valign="top">the edging on the sun bothers me, but it''s a nice composition still. The left side does feel flatter than the right, though. 6</td>', 'the edging on the sun bothers me, but it''s a nice composition still. The left side does feel flatter than the right, though. 6', '2005-06-27 23:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487509, 195818, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice portrait. 6</td>', 'nice portrait. 6', '2005-06-27 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487511, 196161, 34247, '<td valign="top">i''d wish for more contrast between sky and ground. it''s a nice composition, but feels flat to me. a bit more red tones would have made a more effective shot for me. 6</td>', 'i''d wish for more contrast between sky and ground. it''s a nice composition, but feels flat to me. a bit more red tones would have made a more effective shot for me. 6', '2005-06-27 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487513, 196283, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice composition, and the reflective left side grabs me. but i do wish there was a bit more texture here in terms of color and contrast. 6</td>', 'nice composition, and the reflective left side grabs me. but i do wish there was a bit more texture here in terms of color and contrast. 6', '2005-06-27 23:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487516, 193937, 36006, '<td valign="top">We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challeng. "Everywhere," only, gives it a differant perspective, and  is stronger in presentation.<br/> <br/>Lines nice, nice idea, blacks barely in, whites need work, perspective interesting, nice bit of off balance, but I like it that way, nice dof, lighing flat, great comp, overall good job</td>', 'We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challeng. "Everywhere," only, gives it a differant perspective, and  is stronger in presentation. Lines nice, nice idea, blacks barely in, whites need work, perspective interesting, nice bit of off balance, but I like it that way, nice dof, lighing flat, great comp, overall good job', '2005-06-27 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487519, 196279, 36006, '<td valign="top">We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challeng.  By just saying "Nowhere" gives a differant perspective, and makes the picture that much more stronger.<br/> <br/>nice comp, nice dof, nice lines, blacks good, whites need work, lighing sillouette nice, nice idea, overall good.</td>', 'We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challeng.  By just saying "Nowhere" gives a differant perspective, and makes the picture that much more stronger. nice comp, nice dof, nice lines, blacks good, whites need work, lighing sillouette nice, nice idea, overall good.', '2005-06-27 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487528, 195781, 36006, '<td valign="top">We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challenge.  IMO, I think you could of done better with a differant title. The opportunity that you passed on, to make something truly yours by giving it a name, by actually visuallizing something more original saddens me.<br/> <br/>Great comp,nice dof, nice movement, great lines, blacks ok, whites need work, silouette nice, overall very good.</td>', 'We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challenge.  IMO, I think you could of done better with a differant title. The opportunity that you passed on, to make something truly yours by giving it a name, by actually visuallizing something more original saddens me. Great comp,nice dof, nice movement, great lines, blacks ok, whites need work, silouette nice, overall very good.', '2005-06-28 00:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487532, 196011, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice shot and perspective. would do better with me with more detailing on the walls and perhaps slightly more contrast. 8</td>', 'nice shot and perspective. would do better with me with more detailing on the walls and perhaps slightly more contrast. 8', '2005-06-28 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487538, 195139, 36006, '<td valign="top">We all know that this is a \"Leading Lines\" challenge. IMO, you could of done better on the title.<br/> <br/>NIce use of props, beautiful b&amp;w''s, Some thing funny with the thumbs edging, maybe to much sharpening, geat lighting, nice texture, overall very out of the box, nice job<br/> <br/></td>', 'We all know that this is a \"Leading Lines\" challenge. IMO, you could of done better on the title. NIce use of props, beautiful b&w''s, Some thing funny with the thumbs edging, maybe to much sharpening, geat lighting, nice texture, overall very out of the box, nice job ', '2005-06-28 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487542, 195956, 36006, '<td valign="top">We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challenge.  If by saying "To power your home" only gives a differant perspective, and makes the titleing stronger.<br/> <br/>Nice color, crop needs work buy not bad, nice sillouette, nice lighting, nice dof, overall nice</td>', 'We all know that this is a "Leading Lines" challenge.  If by saying "To power your home" only gives a differant perspective, and makes the titleing stronger. Nice color, crop needs work buy not bad, nice sillouette, nice lighting, nice dof, overall nice', '2005-06-28 00:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487544, 196011, 34763, '<td valign="top">The path to their salvation indeed, Great use of greys and black &amp; white to add character to a very historic church. I''ve tried for the same picture but never this close to perfect. Great work!</td>', 'The path to their salvation indeed, Great use of greys and black & white to add character to a very historic church. I''ve tried for the same picture but never this close to perfect. Great work!', '2005-06-28 00:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487545, 196233, 38793, '<td valign="top">Funny Idea, I love it.  The line doesn''t lead anywhere, but the photo is great. 8</td>', 'Funny Idea, I love it.  The line doesn''t lead anywhere, but the photo is great. 8', '2005-06-28 00:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487547, 193157, 38648, '<td valign="top">Great shot - a 10</td>', 'Great shot - a 10', '2005-06-28 00:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487549, 195588, 38648, '<td valign="top">Great shot - a 10</td>', 'Great shot - a 10', '2005-06-28 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
