(1487555, 196362, 24951, '<td valign="top">Is this over-sharpened or over saturated or some sort of effect used? Much of the detail is lost.</td>', 'Is this over-sharpened or over saturated or some sort of effect used? Much of the detail is lost.', '2005-06-28 00:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
