(1487625, 196166, 4793, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2005-06-28 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487629, 196180, 4793, '<td valign="top">I agree this is intriguing, nice</td>', 'I agree this is intriguing, nice', '2005-06-28 00:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487647, 196262, 39930, '<td valign="top">colorful</td>', 'colorful', '2005-06-28 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487651, 196118, 1993, '<td valign="top">Why the long title?  I just don''t understand...</td>', 'Why the long title?  I just don''t understand...', '2005-06-28 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487658, 195946, 17279, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but the "line" just isn''t there for me, sorry</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but the "line" just isn''t there for me, sorry', '2005-06-28 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487661, 196439, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.', '2005-06-28 01:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487664, 195417, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see the leading lines. Works for me for fitting the challenge. NIce colors, good lighting, good macro. I like the focus/dof you''ve used. It''s a nice subject, but something is just not ''grabbing'' me about the image. Maybe it''s the static, straight on, centered perspective/composition. Perhaps a different, more dramatic angle would make for a stronger presentation?</td>', 'I see the leading lines. Works for me for fitting the challenge. NIce colors, good lighting, good macro. I like the focus/dof you''ve used. It''s a nice subject, but something is just not ''grabbing'' me about the image. Maybe it''s the static, straight on, centered perspective/composition. Perhaps a different, more dramatic angle would make for a stronger presentation?', '2005-06-28 01:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487665, 195715, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like this...fits the challenge well... nice take.</td>', 'I like this...fits the challenge well... nice take.', '2005-06-28 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487667, 196210, 17279, '<td valign="top">Very nice...love the colors/lighting.</td>', 'Very nice...love the colors/lighting.', '2005-06-28 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487672, 196330, 17279, '<td valign="top">The leading line is there, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the water rather than the end of the leading line.</td>', 'The leading line is there, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the water rather than the end of the leading line.', '2005-06-28 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487674, 195071, 15511, '<td valign="top">This has different lines, yet if I could see more detail, I could know more of what intrigues me about the patterns here. If you have the ability, you should make the image as large as the rules allow. If your camera doesn''t have enough resolution, you might consider different subjects.</td>', 'This has different lines, yet if I could see more detail, I could know more of what intrigues me about the patterns here. If you have the ability, you should make the image as large as the rules allow. If your camera doesn''t have enough resolution, you might consider different subjects.', '2005-06-28 01:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487675, 195436, 17279, '<td valign="top">The lines are not prominent enough IMO... I only noticed them as an afterthought.</td>', 'The lines are not prominent enough IMO... I only noticed them as an afterthought.', '2005-06-28 01:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487677, 196433, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice composition... wish there was more of the people or ocean visible in the background</td>', 'Nice composition... wish there was more of the people or ocean visible in the background', '2005-06-28 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487680, 196169, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here...the only thing is that shadow line which really takes away from the impact of this photo (also the branches in the lower left).  I think a different angle on this really would have given this a lot more punch.</td>', 'I like what you did here...the only thing is that shadow line which really takes away from the impact of this photo (also the branches in the lower left).  I think a different angle on this really would have given this a lot more punch.', '2005-06-28 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487681, 195664, 15511, '<td valign="top">A portrait orientation may have accentuated the trees some more. I realize the "road" is the subject, but its uninteresting form detracts from the more interesting things in the image. The color needs a boost.</td>', 'A portrait orientation may have accentuated the trees some more. I realize the "road" is the subject, but its uninteresting form detracts from the more interesting things in the image. The color needs a boost.', '2005-06-28 01:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487685, 196057, 17279, '<td valign="top">This would have been really great if the eye was more prominent...a little more from the left would have added a lot.</td>', 'This would have been really great if the eye was more prominent...a little more from the left would have added a lot.', '2005-06-28 01:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487686, 195269, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2005-06-28 01:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487687, 192816, 19831, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have a good eye here. The road has good lines and a nice aesthetic curve, this image makes a nice scene, but I find it lacking a subject, something to focus on and draw my interest into the image. Perhaps placing a person, or cart or something along the path would give the photo a much stronger impact. There seems to be a bluish tint to the picture, maybe in your photo editing you could tweak the color levels a little.</td>', 'Looks like you have a good eye here. The road has good lines and a nice aesthetic curve, this image makes a nice scene, but I find it lacking a subject, something to focus on and draw my interest into the image. Perhaps placing a person, or cart or something along the path would give the photo a much stronger impact. There seems to be a bluish tint to the picture, maybe in your photo editing you could tweak the color levels a little.', '2005-06-28 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487689, 195270, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wow...great color/composition!</td>', 'Wow...great color/composition!', '2005-06-28 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487693, 196396, 17279, '<td valign="top">The sky is a bit dark, but a nicely composed image.  I''m not sure if color might have been a better choice.</td>', 'The sky is a bit dark, but a nicely composed image.  I''m not sure if color might have been a better choice.', '2005-06-28 01:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487695, 196102, 17279, '<td valign="top">well done!</td>', 'well done!', '2005-06-28 01:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487696, 195804, 17279, '<td valign="top">Love this shot...too bad you have the other starting blocks in the frame.</td>', 'Love this shot...too bad you have the other starting blocks in the frame.', '2005-06-28 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487700, 196403, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. You''ve presented a mundane everyday sight in a creative, interesting way. I like how the towers fade away into the mist. A very slight suggestion for improvement, maybe cropping the top down just a touch, to like the top of the large triangle shape towards the top of the farthest right hand tower? Nice photo, good job.</td>', 'Nice composition. You''ve presented a mundane everyday sight in a creative, interesting way. I like how the towers fade away into the mist. A very slight suggestion for improvement, maybe cropping the top down just a touch, to like the top of the large triangle shape towards the top of the farthest right hand tower? Nice photo, good job.', '2005-06-28 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487704, 195053, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great geometry and colors... I wish you had submitted a larger version, but nicely done!</td>', 'Great geometry and colors... I wish you had submitted a larger version, but nicely done!', '2005-06-28 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487707, 196011, 33542, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any leading lines here</td>', 'I don''t really see any leading lines here', '2005-06-28 02:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
