(1487737, 196426, 8377, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Love the colors, the sharpness is right on as well. I also really like the subject shirt color as it is such a contrast to everything else in the pic. I wish I could shoot photos like this.<br/> :)</td>', 'Great photo. Love the colors, the sharpness is right on as well. I also really like the subject shirt color as it is such a contrast to everything else in the pic. I wish I could shoot photos like this. :)', '2005-06-28 02:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487739, 196180, 19831, '<td valign="top">Oh, great eye. Very cool shot. Great composition. It''s very interesting that, often times in an image like this, you think, what a great scene, I wish there was a person, or some kind of subject there, but in this photo, I find that it has a strong subject that is not actually there. What I mean is, I keep leaning in my chair to the left trying really hard to get a peek at what is just beyond that turn. I find this very cool and stimulating, it really helps draw me into the photo.  My only nitpick with it is, the path looks just slightly blown out, it looks like there is some neat texture there. Perhaps in your editing, you could try using the burn tool over it with the opacity of the layer reduced, this may bring out a lot of extra detail. Good job.</td>', 'Oh, great eye. Very cool shot. Great composition. It''s very interesting that, often times in an image like this, you think, what a great scene, I wish there was a person, or some kind of subject there, but in this photo, I find that it has a strong subject that is not actually there. What I mean is, I keep leaning in my chair to the left trying really hard to get a peek at what is just beyond that turn. I find this very cool and stimulating, it really helps draw me into the photo.  My only nitpick with it is, the path looks just slightly blown out, it looks like there is some neat texture there. Perhaps in your editing, you could try using the burn tool over it with the opacity of the layer reduced, this may bring out a lot of extra detail. Good job.', '2005-06-28 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487740, 196279, 33542, '<td valign="top">colors are too vivid - they look fake - and the pic is a bit pixilated, too... if you don''t have neatimage think about getting it (there is a free version)</td>', 'colors are too vivid - they look fake - and the pic is a bit pixilated, too... if you don''t have neatimage think about getting it (there is a free version)', '2005-06-28 02:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487741, 195945, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love the bright red in this photo. It really makes it stand out. The angle that the photo was shot from really enhances it and makes it very interesting.</td>', 'I love the bright red in this photo. It really makes it stand out. The angle that the photo was shot from really enhances it and makes it very interesting.', '2005-06-28 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487742, 196216, 33542, '<td valign="top">I seriously doubt this road actually leads nowhere... nice picture, although I''d have cropped out more of the sky... it seems you were trying to keep the whole cloud, but I think it detracts from the road, which is supposed to be the subject</td>', 'I seriously doubt this road actually leads nowhere... nice picture, although I''d have cropped out more of the sky... it seems you were trying to keep the whole cloud, but I think it detracts from the road, which is supposed to be the subject', '2005-06-28 02:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487743, 194902, 8377, '<td valign="top">I actually really like the red on red. It really brings out the ring. Very unique idea of having the rose petals be your leading lines! Good use of dof as well.</td>', 'I actually really like the red on red. It really brings out the ring. Very unique idea of having the rose petals be your leading lines! Good use of dof as well.', '2005-06-28 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487744, 196169, 33542, '<td valign="top">you got lucky that she was walking on the line... this is a great photo op, but there are a few things I''d have changed... first, the highlights in the top left are seriously blown, second, there are some distracting elements in the picture. Since this was an advanced editing challenge I''d have attempted to clone out the leaves in the bottom left. I also might have cropped tighter to get ride of more or all of the building in the top right. all in all nice, though. B/W works well here.</td>', 'you got lucky that she was walking on the line... this is a great photo op, but there are a few things I''d have changed... first, the highlights in the top left are seriously blown, second, there are some distracting elements in the picture. Since this was an advanced editing challenge I''d have attempted to clone out the leaves in the bottom left. I also might have cropped tighter to get ride of more or all of the building in the top right. all in all nice, though. B/W works well here.', '2005-06-28 02:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487745, 196347, 8377, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Iike how the cows seem to fade into the background as the picture goes along. Good clarity. Not sure what time of day this was taken (sometime in the evening?), but it''s a really good choice.</td>', 'Very nice, Iike how the cows seem to fade into the background as the picture goes along. Good clarity. Not sure what time of day this was taken (sometime in the evening?), but it''s a really good choice.', '2005-06-28 02:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487746, 193156, 33542, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, but with the size restraints I might have cropped a little tighter on St. Paul''s. b/c the pic couldn''t be any wider than this, all the elements are small.</td>', 'beautiful picture, but with the size restraints I might have cropped a little tighter on St. Paul''s. b/c the pic couldn''t be any wider than this, all the elements are small.', '2005-06-28 02:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487751, 195954, 8377, '<td valign="top">Good colors and sharpness, and I always love the beach :)<br/>Good dof, to keep everything in focus</td>', 'Good colors and sharpness, and I always love the beach :)Good dof, to keep everything in focus', '2005-06-28 02:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487753, 196134, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept. I really like your idea here. The board, and alley formed by the pieces do make great leading lines. Lighting is not bad, but maybe just a tad brighter would strengthen the presentation a little, maybe even just a slight boost in editing. Also I''m thinking, the image doesn''t really seem too busy, but maybe with just a few less pieces, it might make a little bit cleaner, more concise, bolder composition.</td>', 'This is a great concept. I really like your idea here. The board, and alley formed by the pieces do make great leading lines. Lighting is not bad, but maybe just a tad brighter would strengthen the presentation a little, maybe even just a slight boost in editing. Also I''m thinking, the image doesn''t really seem too busy, but maybe with just a few less pieces, it might make a little bit cleaner, more concise, bolder composition.', '2005-06-28 02:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487754, 195828, 8377, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, and I think it''s a great, unique idea for leading lines, the color just seems a bit over saturated to me.</td>', 'I really like this photo, and I think it''s a great, unique idea for leading lines, the color just seems a bit over saturated to me.', '2005-06-28 02:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487755, 195531, 8377, '<td valign="top">Great contrast on this photo, excellent lighting!</td>', 'Great contrast on this photo, excellent lighting!', '2005-06-28 02:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487758, 196386, 8377, '<td valign="top">LOVE the colors in this photo.  I think it may have been even better if the foliage in the foreground was in focus as well, and the house in the bkg was not. Probably a hard shot to get though :)    <br/>I love the expression on her face, it makes me happy.</td>', 'LOVE the colors in this photo.  I think it may have been even better if the foliage in the foreground was in focus as well, and the house in the bkg was not. Probably a hard shot to get though :)    I love the expression on her face, it makes me happy.', '2005-06-28 02:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487761, 195774, 19831, '<td valign="top">Well, usually I can specifically point out things that ''move'' me, and cause me to like an image. In this case though, I can''t quite put my finger on it, but I find I really like this photo. Maybe it''s a bunch of little things that contribute subtly to make it work for me. Perhaps the dof, maybe the lighting, maybe the texture in the wall, perhaps the simple yet bold composition, even the border in this case adds to the presentation IMO. I don''t know, but I just really like it. Great job. :-)</td>', 'Well, usually I can specifically point out things that ''move'' me, and cause me to like an image. In this case though, I can''t quite put my finger on it, but I find I really like this photo. Maybe it''s a bunch of little things that contribute subtly to make it work for me. Perhaps the dof, maybe the lighting, maybe the texture in the wall, perhaps the simple yet bold composition, even the border in this case adds to the presentation IMO. I don''t know, but I just really like it. Great job. :-)', '2005-06-28 02:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487763, 196224, 29474, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little bland. Maybe B&amp;W will make it more dramatic?</td>', 'Seems to be a little bland. Maybe B&W will make it more dramatic?', '2005-06-28 02:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1487770, 192816, 29474, '<td valign="top">A little bland. Also needs some work to remove the blue cast.</td>', 'A little bland. Also needs some work to remove the blue cast.', '2005-06-28 03:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
