(1488760, 196102, 8377, '<td valign="top">It''s a little extreme for my tastes, but still an awesome photo and effect. I love the two people at the end of the tunnel, my eyes do go directly to them.</td>', 'It''s a little extreme for my tastes, but still an awesome photo and effect. I love the two people at the end of the tunnel, my eyes do go directly to them.', '2005-06-28 16:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488764, 196309, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea. I can''t quite decide how I feel about the dof use. A part of me likes this option, but another part wants to see all three red flowers in sharp focus. I''ll have to go back to this at another time, but it''s a 9 for me right now.</td>', 'Beautiful idea. I can''t quite decide how I feel about the dof use. A part of me likes this option, but another part wants to see all three red flowers in sharp focus. I''ll have to go back to this at another time, but it''s a 9 for me right now.', '2005-06-28 16:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488765, 196287, 31443, '<td valign="top">Knowing that the colors of this vegetation can be intense but think you may have been a bit heavy handed on the dodge and burn tools, I like this image a lot though..</td>', 'Knowing that the colors of this vegetation can be intense but think you may have been a bit heavy handed on the dodge and burn tools, I like this image a lot though..', '2005-06-28 16:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
