(1488779, 196131, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, but I feel more contrast would serve this image well. The texturing on the trees could be emphasized more, to complement the spots of light that are nicely broken up by the leaves. 5</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, but I feel more contrast would serve this image well. The texturing on the trees could be emphasized more, to complement the spots of light that are nicely broken up by the leaves. 5', '2005-06-28 16:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
