(1488822, 194315, 811, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t miss from that range. :)<br/> <br/>I like the dramatic lighting on this</td>', 'Hope you didn''t miss from that range. :) I like the dramatic lighting on this', '2005-06-28 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
