(1488834, 196219, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice capture. the sweep of chairs is definitely attractive, and the color work is great. 8</td>', 'nice capture. the sweep of chairs is definitely attractive, and the color work is great. 8', '2005-06-28 16:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488835, 196177, 9964, '<td valign="top">wonderful image!</td>', 'wonderful image!', '2005-06-28 16:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488840, 195944, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture.  If it was planned - great job on the foresight, if it was spontaneous at an event - great timing!  ;^)</td>', 'Very interesting capture.  If it was planned - great job on the foresight, if it was spontaneous at an event - great timing!  ;^)', '2005-06-28 16:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488842, 196416, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice motion.  i would have gone with one or the other child, and i would have erred on the side of cute.  It looks like your bg is overexposed and you magnified the problem by having to dodge the trees to make the kids stand out.  next time try a very wide aperture if your camera allows it to blur out the bg details</td>', 'nice motion.  i would have gone with one or the other child, and i would have erred on the side of cute.  It looks like your bg is overexposed and you magnified the problem by having to dodge the trees to make the kids stand out.  next time try a very wide aperture if your camera allows it to blur out the bg details', '2005-06-28 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488845, 195945, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is great!  Lines lead to the subject and a bit beyond.  The subject is large enough to see but not over-powering...  Good DOF.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is great!  Lines lead to the subject and a bit beyond.  The subject is large enough to see but not over-powering...  Good DOF.  Good luck!', '2005-06-28 16:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488848, 196298, 13688, '<td valign="top">lots of lines here.  unfortunately those center columns seem to block the movement you''re trying to create.  i wish you had found a nice focal point, perhaps some flowers and found a line leading to them...perhaps some of the shadows created by these lines would have done the trick.</td>', 'lots of lines here.  unfortunately those center columns seem to block the movement you''re trying to create.  i wish you had found a nice focal point, perhaps some flowers and found a line leading to them...perhaps some of the shadows created by these lines would have done the trick.', '2005-06-28 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488849, 196145, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love this composition.  You actually have multiple lines with the way the wall is textured along with the road.  The shadow is also a mini-line by itself.  Very good eye to get this one in.  Only downside is the road is a bit hot right up next to the wall - hard to avoid I know.  Very nice!  Good luck.</td>', 'I love this composition.  You actually have multiple lines with the way the wall is textured along with the road.  The shadow is also a mini-line by itself.  Very good eye to get this one in.  Only downside is the road is a bit hot right up next to the wall - hard to avoid I know.  Very nice!  Good luck.', '2005-06-28 16:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488850, 195597, 36199, '<td valign="top">My husband tried to persuade me to do something similar to this !! but i didn''t have the courage or your skill, great piture-9</td>', 'My husband tried to persuade me to do something similar to this !! but i didn''t have the courage or your skill, great piture-9', '2005-06-28 16:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488851, 195621, 13688, '<td valign="top">super crisp, good lighting.  like the blues.  composition is just lacking excitement for me</td>', 'super crisp, good lighting.  like the blues.  composition is just lacking excitement for me', '2005-06-28 16:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488852, 196208, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great use of foreground as a leading element!  This image is right on for this challenge.  I hope the floor was halfway clean!  ;^)</td>', 'Great use of foreground as a leading element!  This image is right on for this challenge.  I hope the floor was halfway clean!  ;^)', '2005-06-28 16:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488853, 196181, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point.  Good job with this one...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and to the point.  Good job with this one...good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-28 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488859, 196304, 13688, '<td valign="top">as you might have gotten already...the border is a bit distracting.  i''m guessing you were going for sort of looking out the ramparts but i''m not sure it worked.  otherwise the lines of the structure are very pleasing.  there could be a bit more contrast for my liking.</td>', 'as you might have gotten already...the border is a bit distracting.  i''m guessing you were going for sort of looking out the ramparts but i''m not sure it worked.  otherwise the lines of the structure are very pleasing.  there could be a bit more contrast for my liking.', '2005-06-28 16:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
