(1488862, 195404, 39664, '<td valign="top">Your skyline looks like it was over "messed with" in Photoshop.....did you oversharpen?  Maybe it''s my monitor but checkout the skyline at the top of the trees and the bleed thru.  It kinda glows.  I like the balance of the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Your skyline looks like it was over "messed with" in Photoshop.....did you oversharpen?  Maybe it''s my monitor but checkout the skyline at the top of the trees and the bleed thru.  It kinda glows.  I like the balance of the rest of the photo.', '2005-06-28 16:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488864, 195937, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great moment, vivid colors are my fav..</td>', 'Great moment, vivid colors are my fav..', '2005-06-28 16:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488867, 196208, 39664, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2005-06-28 16:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
