(1488969, 196312, 20679, '<td valign="top">Oh that Hoya IR filter is getting good use! I really like the effect. I''m not convinced that this is a great example of leading lines however. The edge of the pond (Shoreham perhaps?) leads the eye in some respects but is not strong enough to be the key element as defined by the challenge (IMHO). It does make me want an IR filter however :)  Good luck</td>', 'Oh that Hoya IR filter is getting good use! I really like the effect. I''m not convinced that this is a great example of leading lines however. The edge of the pond (Shoreham perhaps?) leads the eye in some respects but is not strong enough to be the key element as defined by the challenge (IMHO). It does make me want an IR filter however :)  Good luck', '2005-06-28 17:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1488974, 193891, 20679, '<td valign="top">The lens flare works well here and there are definite leading lines. I like it but would have tried to make the sky more interesting with some dodging and burning. There is a lot of potential in that sky....</td>', 'The lens flare works well here and there are definite leading lines. I like it but would have tried to make the sky more interesting with some dodging and burning. There is a lot of potential in that sky....', '2005-06-28 17:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
