(1489585, 195763, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize the beautiful model in this one - she''s your wife (or soon to be), right?  I really like the way you turned this shot on its edge and used an angled line as your horizontal.  It also works very well with the stripes on her dress.  The top of the wall and the grass seem a little blown out to me though (lighting is too bright), but otherwise I think this one''s really cool.  Her pose &amp; expression are very intriguing.  8</td>', 'I think I recognize the beautiful model in this one - she''s your wife (or soon to be), right?  I really like the way you turned this shot on its edge and used an angled line as your horizontal.  It also works very well with the stripes on her dress.  The top of the wall and the grass seem a little blown out to me though (lighting is too bright), but otherwise I think this one''s really cool.  Her pose & expression are very intriguing.  8', '2005-06-28 21:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489611, 193124, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great macro and nice leading lines.  My only two complaints about this image are the muted colors (I think you could have saturated a bit more - especially the greens) and the blurred portion of the butterfly''s upper wings.  Don''t get me wrong, I think this is a real contender for a ribbon.  Really nice work!  9</td>', 'Great macro and nice leading lines.  My only two complaints about this image are the muted colors (I think you could have saturated a bit more - especially the greens) and the blurred portion of the butterfly''s upper wings.  Don''t get me wrong, I think this is a real contender for a ribbon.  Really nice work!  9', '2005-06-28 21:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489617, 196208, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of B/W vs Color.  Beautiful leading lines as well.  My only issue with the image is that it seems awfully busy (once you get above the yellow line).  Not sure whether a tighter crop or gaussian blur would have helped there or not, but I think so.  Very nice work!  8</td>', 'Very effective use of B/W vs Color.  Beautiful leading lines as well.  My only issue with the image is that it seems awfully busy (once you get above the yellow line).  Not sure whether a tighter crop or gaussian blur would have helped there or not, but I think so.  Very nice work!  8', '2005-06-28 21:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1489618, 196357, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice job especially with this weeks celebration! God bless America, Home of the brave and the free. Very nice comp and clarity.</td>', 'Nice job especially with this weeks celebration! God bless America, Home of the brave and the free. Very nice comp and clarity.', '2005-06-28 21:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
