(1490174, 195058, 38072, '<td valign="top">I tried to do something similar -- but I found that I couldn''t get high enough to really see the runway.  I 4-wheeled right up to the airport perimeter fence and set an 8-foot ladder on the top of my chevy blazer and snapped away until airport security came out to ask what the heck I was doing.  Then I didn''t even wind up using the shots.  <br/> <br/>I think that, as with my shots, a higher vantage point would work better to show the runway''s "leading lines" -- but I like the color in your shot.</td>', 'I tried to do something similar -- but I found that I couldn''t get high enough to really see the runway.  I 4-wheeled right up to the airport perimeter fence and set an 8-foot ladder on the top of my chevy blazer and snapped away until airport security came out to ask what the heck I was doing.  Then I didn''t even wind up using the shots.   I think that, as with my shots, a higher vantage point would work better to show the runway''s "leading lines" -- but I like the color in your shot.', '2005-06-29 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
