(1491527, 196428, 31524, '<td valign="top">dont get the lines theme?</td>', 'dont get the lines theme?', '2005-06-29 13:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491533, 194137, 31524, '<td valign="top">just powerful.  Look forward to seeing how it was done.</td>', 'just powerful.  Look forward to seeing how it was done.', '2005-06-29 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491540, 194736, 31524, '<td valign="top">show you can find lines anywhere.  creative</td>', 'show you can find lines anywhere.  creative', '2005-06-29 13:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491543, 196358, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I just feel like the focus falls off a little too fast.  7</td>', 'nice shot, I just feel like the focus falls off a little too fast.  7', '2005-06-29 13:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491545, 195666, 31524, '<td valign="top">very nice.  should win something!!</td>', 'very nice.  should win something!!', '2005-06-29 13:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491557, 195944, 31524, '<td valign="top">couldn''t figure our what to say about this one.  Just really liked it.  Do hope not too much was done in photo shop.  I just tend to still think it might have been captured that way.</td>', 'couldn''t figure our what to say about this one.  Just really liked it.  Do hope not too much was done in photo shop.  I just tend to still think it might have been captured that way.', '2005-06-29 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491565, 193119, 31524, '<td valign="top">doesn''t lead my eye.  confuses it.  Still good use in this category.  Just didn''t  love it</td>', 'doesn''t lead my eye.  confuses it.  Still good use in this category.  Just didn''t  love it', '2005-06-29 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491569, 196084, 31524, '<td valign="top">great colors, and use of the category.  good luck</td>', 'great colors, and use of the category.  good luck', '2005-06-29 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491574, 194196, 31524, '<td valign="top">love it.  Still a flower child at heart.  Nice lines.  Good luck</td>', 'love it.  Still a flower child at heart.  Nice lines.  Good luck', '2005-06-29 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491596, 195724, 31524, '<td valign="top">my kinda picture.  Take me there is what it says.  good lucl</td>', 'my kinda picture.  Take me there is what it says.  good lucl', '2005-06-29 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491660, 194141, 36495, '<td valign="top">Leading lines? I dont see it, but then again, ive been up a long time too. ahaha</td>', 'Leading lines? I dont see it, but then again, ive been up a long time too. ahaha', '2005-06-29 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491984, 196211, 37252, '<td valign="top">overall this is a good phot that definitely meets the challenge. The blurry distorted trees are a bit distracting, but do not ruin the image.  8</td>', 'overall this is a good phot that definitely meets the challenge. The blurry distorted trees are a bit distracting, but do not ruin the image.  8', '2005-06-29 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492022, 196416, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice action, but I feel the shutter speed could have been a bit faster for a better freeze. 5</td>', 'Nice action, but I feel the shutter speed could have been a bit faster for a better freeze. 5', '2005-06-29 15:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492027, 196330, 34247, '<td valign="top">This shot feels and looks unnatural to me. The slight white outlining along the bridge is a distraction. The blue sky has a bland look, as does the water. I do wish there was more reflection of the bridge on the water surface. That would be a nice line theme. 5</td>', 'This shot feels and looks unnatural to me. The slight white outlining along the bridge is a distraction. The blue sky has a bland look, as does the water. I do wish there was more reflection of the bridge on the water surface. That would be a nice line theme. 5', '2005-06-29 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492029, 196151, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and I particularly enjoy the droplets. The green background is thrown off nicely enough, but I can''t help but wish the bokeh was more severe. 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and I particularly enjoy the droplets. The green background is thrown off nicely enough, but I can''t help but wish the bokeh was more severe. 7', '2005-06-29 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492031, 194778, 34247, '<td valign="top">This image feels flat, and I think could benefit substantially from more contrast. 5</td>', 'This image feels flat, and I think could benefit substantially from more contrast. 5', '2005-06-29 15:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492034, 196207, 34247, '<td valign="top">So temporally close to the birds challenge, I think this isn''t as striking as it could have been otherwise. 6</td>', 'So temporally close to the birds challenge, I think this isn''t as striking as it could have been otherwise. 6', '2005-06-29 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492036, 195679, 34247, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the foreground are distractions, imho. Perhaps a crop off would have improved this image, as more contrast would have brought out the details more. 6</td>', 'The shadows on the foreground are distractions, imho. Perhaps a crop off would have improved this image, as more contrast would have brought out the details more. 6', '2005-06-29 15:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492041, 196368, 34247, '<td valign="top">The wires compete very much with the tracks, and in my opinion dilutes the tracks'' potential impact. 5</td>', 'The wires compete very much with the tracks, and in my opinion dilutes the tracks'' potential impact. 5', '2005-06-29 15:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492042, 195417, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. 6</td>', 'Nice macro. 6', '2005-06-29 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492045, 195621, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice minaret. And a nice blue sky. 6</td>', 'Nice minaret. And a nice blue sky. 6', '2005-06-29 15:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492047, 196280, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty image, but I feel there''s a lack of a story being told here. The strongest element here, I feel, is the reflective parts of the cork screw shape, but I''m not convinced that there was enough of an attempt to isolate and feature them. 6</td>', 'It''s a pretty image, but I feel there''s a lack of a story being told here. The strongest element here, I feel, is the reflective parts of the cork screw shape, but I''m not convinced that there was enough of an attempt to isolate and feature them. 6', '2005-06-29 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492049, 195792, 34247, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better for me if the tree clump on the left side of the frame were cropped off. 6</td>', 'This would have worked better for me if the tree clump on the left side of the frame were cropped off. 6', '2005-06-29 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492050, 196312, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty image, but the IR effect is being used and featured a bit too often lately on the site. I''ll score this as I will because I do like it, but I''m frankly getting jaded to the IR. 7</td>', 'It''s a pretty image, but the IR effect is being used and featured a bit too often lately on the site. I''ll score this as I will because I do like it, but I''m frankly getting jaded to the IR. 7', '2005-06-29 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492054, 195285, 11895, '<td valign="top">this looks over processed to me, the leaves are sort of sort looking while the gravel on the road borders on over-sharpenned</td>', 'this looks over processed to me, the leaves are sort of sort looking while the gravel on the road borders on over-sharpenned', '2005-06-29 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492063, 196180, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice line, but boy do I wish for more contrast here. A crop off the top quarter of the frame would also have yielded a more effective image, imho. 6</td>', 'It''s a nice line, but boy do I wish for more contrast here. A crop off the top quarter of the frame would also have yielded a more effective image, imho. 6', '2005-06-29 16:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492069, 196108, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice tones and contrasts for this image. The sharp lines leading up  the mountains themselves also work well here. 9</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice tones and contrasts for this image. The sharp lines leading up  the mountains themselves also work well here. 9', '2005-06-29 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492070, 193157, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and the skew works well. 7</td>', 'Nice perspective and the skew works well. 7', '2005-06-29 16:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492071, 195685, 11895, '<td valign="top">a nice capture that fits the challenge well but it looks fairily heavily processed to me, perhaps a little too much d&amp;b</td>', 'a nice capture that fits the challenge well but it looks fairily heavily processed to me, perhaps a little too much d&b', '2005-06-29 16:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492075, 196364, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but one that I think would work better with a bit more saturation and contrast. 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but one that I think would work better with a bit more saturation and contrast. 7', '2005-06-29 16:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492082, 195139, 34247, '<td valign="top">Too clever, too set up, I feel. I''ll give benefit of the doubt, because in some ways, the idea is different and appeals because of that. 6</td>', 'Too clever, too set up, I feel. I''ll give benefit of the doubt, because in some ways, the idea is different and appeals because of that. 6', '2005-06-29 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492092, 194861, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot; I like the coloring and the overall composition.  However, I feel like a complete idiot, because I am not seeing "leading lines" in it.  Lines- yes, lines leading my eyes somewhere - no.<br/> <br/>Wait a minute!  There is an inferred line between the rock structure on the bottom left and the thingymijiggy out in the water on the right.  This causes the eyes to go right past the boat. If it was intentional, excellent shot, but I bet some voters will "miss" it.  If it was not, well . . .</td>', 'This is a very nice shot; I like the coloring and the overall composition.  However, I feel like a complete idiot, because I am not seeing "leading lines" in it.  Lines- yes, lines leading my eyes somewhere - no. Wait a minute!  There is an inferred line between the rock structure on the bottom left and the thingymijiggy out in the water on the right.  This causes the eyes to go right past the boat. If it was intentional, excellent shot, but I bet some voters will "miss" it.  If it was not, well . . .', '2005-06-29 16:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492096, 195417, 811, '<td valign="top">Good details and color.</td>', 'Good details and color.', '2005-06-29 16:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492104, 196434, 811, '<td valign="top">BW works exceptionally well for this -- establishes a dark, nostalgic mood, I think.</td>', 'BW works exceptionally well for this -- establishes a dark, nostalgic mood, I think.', '2005-06-29 16:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492118, 195071, 20115, '<td valign="top">I am sure you have been told to read about how to make your photo ready for the site.</td>', 'I am sure you have been told to read about how to make your photo ready for the site.', '2005-06-29 16:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492120, 196437, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the centered composition of this shot doesn''t make it very effective.  Perhaps approaching the archway at more of an angle, especially if there were visible "mowing" lines in the grass would have strengthened it, both as a photograph and in the "challenge" aspects.</td>', 'I think the centered composition of this shot doesn''t make it very effective.  Perhaps approaching the archway at more of an angle, especially if there were visible "mowing" lines in the grass would have strengthened it, both as a photograph and in the "challenge" aspects.', '2005-06-29 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492131, 196202, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed image, a little bright in the sky and a little dark in the right foreground. It''s potentially a wonderful shot. But it doesn''t really speak to the challenge in the sense that I don''t really feel any "lines" other than the arc of the subject dam itself, and those don''t "lead" me anywhere.</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed image, a little bright in the sky and a little dark in the right foreground. It''s potentially a wonderful shot. But it doesn''t really speak to the challenge in the sense that I don''t really feel any "lines" other than the arc of the subject dam itself, and those don''t "lead" me anywhere.', '2005-06-29 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492135, 196176, 30861, '<td valign="top">This feels hyper-saturated to me, and not in a good way. The sky is not your subject, but it''s stealing all the thunder. The leading lines are decently interesting.</td>', 'This feels hyper-saturated to me, and not in a good way. The sky is not your subject, but it''s stealing all the thunder. The leading lines are decently interesting.', '2005-06-29 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492142, 195404, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really wish for two things here: first, that youy had squared the verticals up, it''s all leaning right uncomfortably. Second, that you had burned in the lower left so it darkened as it neared the corner. That empty space is a negative in your composition. I understand why it has to be there, so you can have enough track, but work with it so it complements the subject. The leading line aspect is very nice, and the muted use of glow is quite attractive.</td>', 'I really wish for two things here: first, that youy had squared the verticals up, it''s all leaning right uncomfortably. Second, that you had burned in the lower left so it darkened as it neared the corner. That empty space is a negative in your composition. I understand why it has to be there, so you can have enough track, but work with it so it complements the subject. The leading line aspect is very nice, and the muted use of glow is quite attractive.', '2005-06-29 16:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492154, 193124, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, a unique perspective on the butterfly, but it''s very much a "rule of thirds" image, and isn''t a good exemplar of leading lines IMO.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, a unique perspective on the butterfly, but it''s very much a "rule of thirds" image, and isn''t a good exemplar of leading lines IMO.', '2005-06-29 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492160, 193156, 30861, '<td valign="top">sweet and understaed. Classic leading lines solution, if a bit obvious. I like very much that you have resisted oversaturating to add "pop"</td>', 'sweet and understaed. Classic leading lines solution, if a bit obvious. I like very much that you have resisted oversaturating to add "pop"', '2005-06-29 16:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492165, 196367, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great macro, though it were better cropped square, eliminating most of the left side I think. Howevere, there''s absolutely NO sense of leading lines here.</td>', 'Great macro, though it were better cropped square, eliminating most of the left side I think. Howevere, there''s absolutely NO sense of leading lines here.', '2005-06-29 16:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492168, 196371, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is cool, wish it wasn''t quite so dark, I''d like to see a little more detail</td>', 'this is cool, wish it wasn''t quite so dark, I''d like to see a little more detail', '2005-06-29 16:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492171, 196224, 30861, '<td valign="top">i SO wish the cone were sharp... This is nicely seen, and it''s a good example of leading lines.</td>', 'i SO wish the cone were sharp... This is nicely seen, and it''s a good example of leading lines.', '2005-06-29 16:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492172, 196425, 811, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot -- dark and mysterious</td>', 'Nicely shot -- dark and mysterious', '2005-06-29 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492175, 196211, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting effect.  Kinda a Dorothy (yellow brick road) meets God kinda thing.</td>', 'That''s an interesting effect.  Kinda a Dorothy (yellow brick road) meets God kinda thing.', '2005-06-29 16:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492176, 195591, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, muted rendering of the scene. I can almost taste the tranquility. It feels a little soft, even though I''m not a proponent of always-tack-sharp voting.</td>', 'Beautiful, muted rendering of the scene. I can almost taste the tranquility. It feels a little soft, even though I''m not a proponent of always-tack-sharp voting.', '2005-06-29 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492178, 196382, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot for Leading Lines! The colors are vibrant, the focus crisp, the composition perfect. This one better win the blue !  I''d give you a 20 if possible</td>', 'Excellent shot for Leading Lines! The colors are vibrant, the focus crisp, the composition perfect. This one better win the blue !  I''d give you a 20 if possible', '2005-06-29 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492179, 195096, 30861, '<td valign="top">haha, this is a hoot! I''m not 100% sure this really, truly qualifies as "leading lines", but who am I to say? I like it!</td>', 'haha, this is a hoot! I''m not 100% sure this really, truly qualifies as "leading lines", but who am I to say? I like it!', '2005-06-29 16:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492183, 195496, 37252, '<td valign="top">cool sky shot, but the lines don''t really lead my eye to a subject.  6</td>', 'cool sky shot, but the lines don''t really lead my eye to a subject.  6', '2005-06-29 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492184, 196424, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s pure... Great lighting and tonalities, wonderful journey down the lines...</td>', 'Well, that''s pure... Great lighting and tonalities, wonderful journey down the lines...', '2005-06-29 16:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492186, 196338, 811, '<td valign="top">The waterfall is a bit blown out on my monitor (which usually views everything darker than normal), but otherwise an excellent capture!</td>', 'The waterfall is a bit blown out on my monitor (which usually views everything darker than normal), but otherwise an excellent capture!', '2005-06-29 16:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492189, 196102, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wowza! You may get hammered on softness, but I think this is absolutely wonderful. Certainly, it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Wowza! You may get hammered on softness, but I think this is absolutely wonderful. Certainly, it meets the challenge.', '2005-06-29 16:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492196, 196262, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lines, yes, but "leading"? Not really. The lines ARE the subject, as it were, and they don''t actually "take" us anywhere. The lighting seems rather pedestrian, also, and the pure black BG is adding nothing of interest for me.</td>', 'Lines, yes, but "leading"? Not really. The lines ARE the subject, as it were, and they don''t actually "take" us anywhere. The lighting seems rather pedestrian, also, and the pure black BG is adding nothing of interest for me.', '2005-06-29 16:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492207, 196108, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice conversion, strong leading line. One would have wished for a bit more impact in the destination, as it were; in this shot the road is of more power than the mountains, which probably isn''t ideal. Still and all, a strong entry.</td>', 'Nice conversion, strong leading line. One would have wished for a bit more impact in the destination, as it were; in this shot the road is of more power than the mountains, which probably isn''t ideal. Still and all, a strong entry.', '2005-06-29 16:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492217, 196362, 30861, '<td valign="top">A fascinating scene, but unfortunately (IMO) a deeply flawed rendering. It leans to the right badly, so some ccw rotation would be in order. There''s a LOT of reticulation, pebbling of the surfaces. This is so extreme it looks as if you may have added it in with a texture filter, but it''s possible this is extreme sharpening artifacts, I don''t know. I''d like to see the original on this one after the challenge, if you care to show it to me.</td>', 'A fascinating scene, but unfortunately (IMO) a deeply flawed rendering. It leans to the right badly, so some ccw rotation would be in order. There''s a LOT of reticulation, pebbling of the surfaces. This is so extreme it looks as if you may have added it in with a texture filter, but it''s possible this is extreme sharpening artifacts, I don''t know. I''d like to see the original on this one after the challenge, if you care to show it to me.', '2005-06-29 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492220, 195824, 11895, '<td valign="top">this looks too heavily manipulated, more like a painting than a photograph</td>', 'this looks too heavily manipulated, more like a painting than a photograph', '2005-06-29 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492224, 196330, 30861, '<td valign="top">The lean to the right hurts. The oevrall greenish cast hurts a lot. Excessive foreground is adding nothing; it denatures the imapct of the main subject. The diagonal line is very powerful, but it''s only marginally a leading line IMO. The post processing that gives a soft glow to the concrete is very nice.</td>', 'The lean to the right hurts. The oevrall greenish cast hurts a lot. Excessive foreground is adding nothing; it denatures the imapct of the main subject. The diagonal line is very powerful, but it''s only marginally a leading line IMO. The post processing that gives a soft glow to the concrete is very nice.', '2005-06-29 16:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492225, 194141, 37252, '<td valign="top">a snapshot of your cat...while cute it does not fulfill the challenge. Leading Lines - meaning lines that lead the eye to a subject. The lines should be so clear they grab your eye and lead it directly to a specific subject.</td>', 'a snapshot of your cat...while cute it does not fulfill the challenge. Leading Lines - meaning lines that lead the eye to a subject. The lines should be so clear they grab your eye and lead it directly to a specific subject.', '2005-06-29 16:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492239, 194861, 30861, '<td valign="top">Man, this REALLY needs leveling of the horizon. It''s a critical falw in this shot. The noise police will hammer you on this, but I like the texture of it. In your conversion you might have tried for more luminosity. However, all that said I don''t really see a leading line here.</td>', 'Man, this REALLY needs leveling of the horizon. It''s a critical falw in this shot. The noise police will hammer you on this, but I like the texture of it. In your conversion you might have tried for more luminosity. However, all that said I don''t really see a leading line here.', '2005-06-29 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492260, 195724, 39973, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp.</td>', 'Not quite sharp.', '2005-06-29 16:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492267, 196134, 39973, '<td valign="top">Good attempt, maybe a little more work on color and focus.</td>', 'Good attempt, maybe a little more work on color and focus.', '2005-06-29 16:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492270, 196321, 39973, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a little more stop action, maybe not a good choice for this challenge.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a little more stop action, maybe not a good choice for this challenge.', '2005-06-29 16:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492277, 196093, 39973, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little more work with the color, dosen''t quite look natural.</td>', 'Maybe a little more work with the color, dosen''t quite look natural.', '2005-06-29 16:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492281, 194176, 39973, '<td valign="top">Not quite there on you''re exposure, watch for more clarity in the shadows.</td>', 'Not quite there on you''re exposure, watch for more clarity in the shadows.', '2005-06-29 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492285, 196170, 39973, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but there is a little lack of focus, the eye is not sure where to go.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but there is a little lack of focus, the eye is not sure where to go.', '2005-06-29 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492341, 192708, 5792, '<td valign="top">Leading lines or curves generally have two purposes. One is to lead the viewer into the scene. The other is to lead you toward the main subject. It is most effective if they come in from the lower left because that is the natural direction humans visually scan a picture from so are easiest to pick up.<br/> <br/>Classic and fine example of a leading line. Congrats, you nailed the challenge topic perfectly.</td>', 'Leading lines or curves generally have two purposes. One is to lead the viewer into the scene. The other is to lead you toward the main subject. It is most effective if they come in from the lower left because that is the natural direction humans visually scan a picture from so are easiest to pick up. Classic and fine example of a leading line. Congrats, you nailed the challenge topic perfectly.', '2005-06-29 17:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492345, 196379, 20115, '<td valign="top">I love this--but I would have cropped out the the posts on the right where I can also see the ocean.  They the focus would have been totally on the opening at the end of the pier.</td>', 'I love this--but I would have cropped out the the posts on the right where I can also see the ocean.  They the focus would have been totally on the opening at the end of the pier.', '2005-06-29 17:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492367, 194141, 17033, '<td valign="top">//www.mycathatesyou.com/</td>', '//www.mycathatesyou.com/', '2005-06-29 17:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492407, 196108, 5792, '<td valign="top">Leading lines or curves generally have two purposes. One is to lead the viewer into the scene. The other is to lead you toward the main subject. It is most effective if they come in from the lower left because that is the natural direction humans visually scan a picture from so are easiest to pick up.<br/> <br/>This B&amp;W is a fundamentally perfect textbook example of leading lines in an exceptionally fine composition. It meets the challenge the best of all entries. The sweeping lines are a major element that supports and directs attention to the main subject in an eye catching way without overwhelming the main subject and taking over the composition.<br/> <br/>Kudos to you for a great image!</td>', 'Leading lines or curves generally have two purposes. One is to lead the viewer into the scene. The other is to lead you toward the main subject. It is most effective if they come in from the lower left because that is the natural direction humans visually scan a picture from so are easiest to pick up. This B&W is a fundamentally perfect textbook example of leading lines in an exceptionally fine composition. It meets the challenge the best of all entries. The sweeping lines are a major element that supports and directs attention to the main subject in an eye catching way without overwhelming the main subject and taking over the composition. Kudos to you for a great image!', '2005-06-29 17:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
