(1492877, 195523, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and shot.  This is a textbook example, in my mind (is their any other?), of leading lines, and I think this should do well.  Aside from the visible lines obviously shown in the image, there are more abstract lines of connection from one boat to the next, of which you were obviously aware...hey, it''s in your title.  I hope this does well, as it would give me more faith in the community here on the whole.  It doesn''t have a tweaked sky (seemingly), no heavy dodging/burning (apparently), and just gets us back to a more simple and pure type of photography (hopefully).  Good luck.</td>', 'Very well seen and shot.  This is a textbook example, in my mind (is their any other?), of leading lines, and I think this should do well.  Aside from the visible lines obviously shown in the image, there are more abstract lines of connection from one boat to the next, of which you were obviously aware...hey, it''s in your title.  I hope this does well, as it would give me more faith in the community here on the whole.  It doesn''t have a tweaked sky (seemingly), no heavy dodging/burning (apparently), and just gets us back to a more simple and pure type of photography (hopefully).  Good luck.', '2005-06-29 19:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492891, 192712, 23053, '<td valign="top">Fan-frickin''-tabulous!  I don''t care if you set this up, I''m almost sure that you did.  I like the contrasty tones and the excellent composition.  About the only thing I don''t like are the girl''s shoes...hmmm...who cares about that though, really.  Good luck and have a good day.</td>', 'Fan-frickin''-tabulous!  I don''t care if you set this up, I''m almost sure that you did.  I like the contrasty tones and the excellent composition.  About the only thing I don''t like are the girl''s shoes...hmmm...who cares about that though, really.  Good luck and have a good day.', '2005-06-29 19:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
