(1493037, 195511, 2764, '<td valign="top">excellent leading lines - the pipes lead the viewers eyes into the photo and that sproingy thing catches your eye and brings it back for another look - a useful thing especially in the speed challenge where one the eye gets led off the edge of the image the brain sayd "Done, nest picture please"</td>', 'excellent leading lines - the pipes lead the viewers eyes into the photo and that sproingy thing catches your eye and brings it back for another look - a useful thing especially in the speed challenge where one the eye gets led off the edge of the image the brain sayd "Done, nest picture please"', '2005-06-29 20:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493041, 196439, 2764, '<td valign="top">Leading lines, yes, but are they effective?  they lead my eyes straight off the pictures edge swiftly.  When the eye comes to the edge of the photo, the brain says "Done, next picture please"  unless there is a counter line to draw the viewer back its over.</td>', 'Leading lines, yes, but are they effective?  they lead my eyes straight off the pictures edge swiftly.  When the eye comes to the edge of the photo, the brain says "Done, next picture please"  unless there is a counter line to draw the viewer back its over.', '2005-06-29 20:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
