(1493222, 196152, 2764, '<td valign="top">The leading lines work - they point straight to the man - why is he so interesting? because he has a bandage on his knee?  Bright sun is soo hard to work with.  Getting the exposure right for the sun and the shade.  your shade looks perfect but that leaves your subjects over exposed ("blown out"), maybe it sould have been better to expose for the sun and let the shaded areas be too dark, the background is less important to this scene.</td>', 'The leading lines work - they point straight to the man - why is he so interesting? because he has a bandage on his knee?  Bright sun is soo hard to work with.  Getting the exposure right for the sun and the shade.  your shade looks perfect but that leaves your subjects over exposed ("blown out"), maybe it sould have been better to expose for the sun and let the shaded areas be too dark, the background is less important to this scene.', '2005-06-29 21:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493250, 196010, 2764, '<td valign="top">I know this is part of a playground structure but the photo doesnt tell me so, nor does it obscure what it is enough to make it intriguing.  What is the leading line?  the pole over the suspension bridge?  what does it lead me to look at?  the bolts holding it on?  the hump that I know to be a tunnel slide but doesnt look like one? why?  why do you want me to look at the tunnel? Also the sun is very high in the sky wich makes lighting very difficult, the yellows all seem overexposed.</td>', 'I know this is part of a playground structure but the photo doesnt tell me so, nor does it obscure what it is enough to make it intriguing.  What is the leading line?  the pole over the suspension bridge?  what does it lead me to look at?  the bolts holding it on?  the hump that I know to be a tunnel slide but doesnt look like one? why?  why do you want me to look at the tunnel? Also the sun is very high in the sky wich makes lighting very difficult, the yellows all seem overexposed.', '2005-06-29 21:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493255, 193124, 2764, '<td valign="top">wow - a critter with his own leading lines - I like it</td>', 'wow - a critter with his own leading lines - I like it', '2005-06-29 21:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493387, 196391, 37252, '<td valign="top">where does it lead? Leading Lines ..... lines that lead the eye to the subject.  You lack a subject.</td>', 'where does it lead? Leading Lines ..... lines that lead the eye to the subject.  You lack a subject.', '2005-06-29 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493500, 195053, 38267, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! This would have be sweet for the triangle challenge<br/>Would have been nice if the picture was larger in size so that you could see more detail.</td>', 'Cool shot! This would have be sweet for the triangle challengeWould have been nice if the picture was larger in size so that you could see more detail.', '2005-06-29 22:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1493525, 195282, 38267, '<td valign="top">My suggestion would be that maybe you should have taken the shot with less sky, especially since there were not any nice clouds or color on the day and time you took the picture.  Maybe you could have also taken the shot a little lower, closer to the level of the fence, looking up the hill more to capture the grass and fence (less sky).  It would have also allowed for you to capture more of the detail in the grass and old fence.   Best of luck in the challenge.  I hope you don''t take the comments the wrong way.</td>', 'My suggestion would be that maybe you should have taken the shot with less sky, especially since there were not any nice clouds or color on the day and time you took the picture.  Maybe you could have also taken the shot a little lower, closer to the level of the fence, looking up the hill more to capture the grass and fence (less sky).  It would have also allowed for you to capture more of the detail in the grass and old fence.   Best of luck in the challenge.  I hope you don''t take the comments the wrong way.', '2005-06-29 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
