(1494169, 196366, 34547, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what others will think but I like the graininess and the slightly faded colors. It reminds me of more nostalgiac times.</td>', 'I don''t know what others will think but I like the graininess and the slightly faded colors. It reminds me of more nostalgiac times.', '2005-06-30 03:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
