(1494579, 196177, 30364, '<td valign="top">People are always complaining in the forums that they get no comments from voters who give them low scores.  So, here goes.  I''m afraid I gave this a 4, because it has nothing to do with leading lines.  To me, the presence of the rail tracks is not enough, they''ve got to actually lead the viewer somewhere, &amp; these don''t.  I suppose you could also say the girls'' legs are leading lines, but that would be a stretch (excuse the pun).  That actual photograph is technically competent, which is why I''m risking your wrath by explaining my low score.  Sorry!</td>', 'People are always complaining in the forums that they get no comments from voters who give them low scores.  So, here goes.  I''m afraid I gave this a 4, because it has nothing to do with leading lines.  To me, the presence of the rail tracks is not enough, they''ve got to actually lead the viewer somewhere, & these don''t.  I suppose you could also say the girls'' legs are leading lines, but that would be a stretch (excuse the pun).  That actual photograph is technically competent, which is why I''m risking your wrath by explaining my low score.  Sorry!', '2005-06-30 09:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
