(1494674, 196208, 30857, '<td valign="top">One of the best pictures for this challenge in my opinion. Selective desat enhances the visual strengh of it. Funny look from the passenger, bet he/she thought you were nuts :P</td>', 'One of the best pictures for this challenge in my opinion. Selective desat enhances the visual strengh of it. Funny look from the passenger, bet he/she thought you were nuts :P', '2005-06-30 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
