(1494681, 192708, 30857, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, perfect for this challenge. I wish greens were more vivid though, then it would go straight to my favorites. Good luck in this challenge!!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, perfect for this challenge. I wish greens were more vivid though, then it would go straight to my favorites. Good luck in this challenge!!', '2005-06-30 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
