(1494805, 196297, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how I LOVE this picture!    I have a weakness for good animal pictures, and especially on this one where the angle is so interesting, and the colors are so vibrant!   Great job!</td>', 'Oh how I LOVE this picture!    I have a weakness for good animal pictures, and especially on this one where the angle is so interesting, and the colors are so vibrant!   Great job!', '2005-06-30 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
