(1494937, 195781, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty.   That is such a striking bridge, and that great sky, along withthe black and white, and the hazy backgground elements.   I just love this photo.</td>', 'How pretty.   That is such a striking bridge, and that great sky, along withthe black and white, and the hazy backgground elements.   I just love this photo.', '2005-06-30 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
