(1496265, 194991, 39144, '<td valign="top">Seems a little tilted toward the right. Was that intentional? If so, why?</td>', 'Seems a little tilted toward the right. Was that intentional? If so, why?', '2005-06-30 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496275, 192816, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon.  Seems to have a blue cast.</td>', 'Nice compositon.  Seems to have a blue cast.', '2005-06-30 22:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496279, 193047, 39144, '<td valign="top">too plain</td>', 'too plain', '2005-06-30 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496284, 196358, 39144, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more focus on the water droplet, but it is still a great photo. 8</td>', 'Needs a little more focus on the water droplet, but it is still a great photo. 8', '2005-06-30 22:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496293, 196419, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. There does seem to be a high amount of haze though. Did you try PP to correct this at all?</td>', 'Excellent composition. There does seem to be a high amount of haze though. Did you try PP to correct this at all?', '2005-06-30 22:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496298, 196379, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent picture, if you ask me. Perfect timing.  Love the water droplets and the fact that it was taken at low tide, so the barnacles are exposed on pilings. Even with the direct sunlight there are no washed out areas. Great Job!</td>', 'This is an excellent picture, if you ask me. Perfect timing.  Love the water droplets and the fact that it was taken at low tide, so the barnacles are exposed on pilings. Even with the direct sunlight there are no washed out areas. Great Job!', '2005-06-30 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496300, 196251, 20530, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines. But my eye doesn''t seem to be "led" to any particular focal point. Very interesting, though.</td>', 'Lots of lines. But my eye doesn''t seem to be "led" to any particular focal point. Very interesting, though.', '2005-06-30 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496315, 195523, 20530, '<td valign="top">Subtle, yet effective.</td>', 'Subtle, yet effective.', '2005-06-30 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496342, 196433, 20530, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Going to Anna Maria for 4th of July weekend. Fits the challenge perfectly. There is a subject(s) at end of lines. Something many entries are lacking. Can''t think of any improvements.</td>', 'Awesome. Going to Anna Maria for 4th of July weekend. Fits the challenge perfectly. There is a subject(s) at end of lines. Something many entries are lacking. Can''t think of any improvements.', '2005-06-30 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496348, 194141, 20530, '<td valign="top">That cat looks like he has personality!</td>', 'That cat looks like he has personality!', '2005-06-30 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496350, 196272, 20530, '<td valign="top">Great timing on that capture.</td>', 'Great timing on that capture.', '2005-06-30 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496367, 195269, 35645, '<td valign="top">I love how this just seems to suck you right into the photo. This is really a great photo.</td>', 'I love how this just seems to suck you right into the photo. This is really a great photo.', '2005-06-30 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496369, 195675, 35645, '<td valign="top">Normally with a photo with this much saturation and overpowering color I''d be put off, but here it works quite well. Beautifully lit and beautifully composed.</td>', 'Normally with a photo with this much saturation and overpowering color I''d be put off, but here it works quite well. Beautifully lit and beautifully composed.', '2005-06-30 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496372, 195669, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful in its simplicity. I like the ''ghostly'' leaves in the background as well. Very well done.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful in its simplicity. I like the ''ghostly'' leaves in the background as well. Very well done.', '2005-06-30 23:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496375, 196073, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. The composition and crop on this are just perfect. Beautiful clean lines, gorgeous color. Very nicely done abstract of the bridge.</td>', 'Wow. The composition and crop on this are just perfect. Beautiful clean lines, gorgeous color. Very nicely done abstract of the bridge.', '2005-06-30 23:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496377, 196326, 35645, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if it''s me or not, but your horizon doesn''t seem quite level. On a good note, I love the water meeting the sand, and the inclusion of a human subject really makes the picture.</td>', 'Don''t know if it''s me or not, but your horizon doesn''t seem quite level. On a good note, I love the water meeting the sand, and the inclusion of a human subject really makes the picture.', '2005-06-30 23:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496385, 196296, 35645, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to figure out what this was, and now that I have, I think it''s an even more interesting photo. I like the unusual viewpoint, and I love the DOF that you''ve chosen. Very nice.</td>', 'Took me a minute to figure out what this was, and now that I have, I think it''s an even more interesting photo. I like the unusual viewpoint, and I love the DOF that you''ve chosen. Very nice.', '2005-06-30 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496389, 196108, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. This would make a great print. I don''t think this would have had as much visual impact had it been in color.</td>', 'Very nice shot. This would make a great print. I don''t think this would have had as much visual impact had it been in color.', '2005-06-30 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496394, 194252, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the composition on this. The light seems a touch harsh on the boat. Very peaceful colors throughout the pic. Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the composition on this. The light seems a touch harsh on the boat. Very peaceful colors throughout the pic. Nicely done.', '2005-06-30 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496396, 196424, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is an AWESOME photo! I love everything about this. This is just a great shot. 10.</td>', 'This is an AWESOME photo! I love everything about this. This is just a great shot. 10.', '2005-06-30 23:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496404, 196211, 30822, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, but the image is a little crooked and it looks like you did some serious dodging sround the cross to make it pop more and the tees seem to be out of focus. IMHO.</td>', 'Well exposed, but the image is a little crooked and it looks like you did some serious dodging sround the cross to make it pop more and the tees seem to be out of focus. IMHO.', '2005-06-30 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496408, 193119, 30822, '<td valign="top">Neat abstract image and well exposed. But where are my eyes being led to?</td>', 'Neat abstract image and well exposed. But where are my eyes being led to?', '2005-06-30 23:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496410, 196205, 30822, '<td valign="top">INteresting picture, but as with many others here, where are the lines leading?</td>', 'INteresting picture, but as with many others here, where are the lines leading?', '2005-06-30 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496414, 195094, 30822, '<td valign="top">Shadows in the top of pic are distracting. Also where are the lines leading to?</td>', 'Shadows in the top of pic are distracting. Also where are the lines leading to?', '2005-06-30 23:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496417, 196368, 30822, '<td valign="top">Photo is well exposed, but IMHO the pic would have worked better shot from a very low angle along the track, I know this isn''t always possible due to legal and saftey issues.</td>', 'Photo is well exposed, but IMHO the pic would have worked better shot from a very low angle along the track, I know this isn''t always possible due to legal and saftey issues.', '2005-06-30 23:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496419, 195993, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, but very over exposed IMHO.</td>', 'Nice lines, but very over exposed IMHO.', '2005-06-30 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496424, 196010, 30822, '<td valign="top">The bar leads to the tunnel very well but this picture doesn''t POP for me. Maybe if a child were in it.</td>', 'The bar leads to the tunnel very well but this picture doesn''t POP for me. Maybe if a child were in it.', '2005-06-30 23:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496431, 195675, 30822, '<td valign="top">INteresting image, but why make the sky Purple? Also there is some overlap of the colors in tree branchs on the left.</td>', 'INteresting image, but why make the sky Purple? Also there is some overlap of the colors in tree branchs on the left.', '2005-06-30 23:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496435, 196312, 33392, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to look at this one.  I really like it.  Something about the vivid white of the trees against the dark sky and water.  I have to admit, though, that I keep struggling to pick up on the "leading lines" aspect of it.<br/> <br/>It is one of my favorites from this challenge, even if I''m having trouble making it ''fit''.  well done.</td>', 'I keep coming back to look at this one.  I really like it.  Something about the vivid white of the trees against the dark sky and water.  I have to admit, though, that I keep struggling to pick up on the "leading lines" aspect of it. It is one of my favorites from this challenge, even if I''m having trouble making it ''fit''.  well done.', '2005-06-30 23:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496436, 196339, 30822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is to harsh so image looks very flat. Try using flash from side or higher up.</td>', 'Lighting is to harsh so image looks very flat. Try using flash from side or higher up.', '2005-06-30 23:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496440, 196071, 30822, '<td valign="top">Just way to busy for me.</td>', 'Just way to busy for me.', '2005-06-30 23:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496460, 192712, 37334, '<td valign="top">Beautiful;)</td>', 'Beautiful;)', '2005-06-30 23:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496526, 193157, 36619, '<td valign="top">the tilted angle is great.</td>', 'the tilted angle is great.', '2005-07-01 00:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496552, 195704, 811, '<td valign="top">Is that a perspective issue, or is the right wall falling in??<br/> <br/>Nice colors.  Like the rich sky</td>', 'Is that a perspective issue, or is the right wall falling in?? Nice colors.  Like the rich sky', '2005-07-01 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496557, 196312, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how the water looks so smoothe and glass-like.</td>', 'I really like how the water looks so smoothe and glass-like.', '2005-07-01 00:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496601, 193041, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome perspective. Composed very nicely. Cool shot.</td>', 'This is an awesome perspective. Composed very nicely. Cool shot.', '2005-07-01 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496613, 196289, 811, '<td valign="top">To me, I think flipping the shot horizontally so that the eyes are led left to right would have made it stronger</td>', 'To me, I think flipping the shot horizontally so that the eyes are led left to right would have made it stronger', '2005-07-01 00:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496620, 196347, 811, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field.  I like how the one (upon closer look, two) cows are looking at the camera, but no others.</td>', 'Good depth of field.  I like how the one (upon closer look, two) cows are looking at the camera, but no others.', '2005-07-01 00:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496622, 196329, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Awesome texture and detail here. Great choice and great job on the b/w. I think your border in this case is very tasteful and adds to the presentation of this image. Heck, I even like your title :-) Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Awesome texture and detail here. Great choice and great job on the b/w. I think your border in this case is very tasteful and adds to the presentation of this image. Heck, I even like your title :-) Nice job.', '2005-07-01 00:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496639, 195685, 19831, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition. Very nice.</td>', 'Stunning composition. Very nice.', '2005-07-01 01:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496645, 194910, 811, '<td valign="top">The leading lines are very subtle.  I think a tighter crop would have made this more interesting.</td>', 'The leading lines are very subtle.  I think a tighter crop would have made this more interesting.', '2005-07-01 01:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
