(1497614, 193119, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines, but I don''t really find them to be leading me anywhere in particular.</td>', 'Lots of lines, but I don''t really find them to be leading me anywhere in particular.', '2005-07-01 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497617, 195588, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very striking-colourful and sharp. Perhaps not quite centred as much as it could be.</td>', 'Very striking-colourful and sharp. Perhaps not quite centred as much as it could be.', '2005-07-01 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497618, 196384, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the effect of the lines to be a little spoilt, as the very tip of the leaf in the bottom right looks a little soft and that seems to be the point that the lines draw my eye to.</td>', 'I find the effect of the lines to be a little spoilt, as the very tip of the leaf in the bottom right looks a little soft and that seems to be the point that the lines draw my eye to.', '2005-07-01 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497619, 195724, 24212, '<td valign="top">This looks too bright for my tastes.It''s a lovely shot otherwise.</td>', 'This looks too bright for my tastes.It''s a lovely shot otherwise.', '2005-07-01 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497624, 195047, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that this perhaps could be a bit sharper and that maybe the cross could be dodged a bit to make it stand out a bit better from the sky.</td>', 'I think that this perhaps could be a bit sharper and that maybe the cross could be dodged a bit to make it stand out a bit better from the sky.', '2005-07-01 15:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497625, 195829, 6597, '<td valign="top">This leads right in to the Mountain</td>', 'This leads right in to the Mountain', '2005-07-01 15:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497628, 195199, 24212, '<td valign="top">The shore lines seem to lead in to the centre of the picture, where there''s not much to see. Perhaps the centre of the shore line could have been darkened a little bit, so as to differentiate it from the rest?</td>', 'The shore lines seem to lead in to the centre of the picture, where there''s not much to see. Perhaps the centre of the shore line could have been darkened a little bit, so as to differentiate it from the rest?', '2005-07-01 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497629, 194736, 24212, '<td valign="top">To my eye, this could be somewhat sharper. I like the way that the twigs are leading to the ripple.</td>', 'To my eye, this could be somewhat sharper. I like the way that the twigs are leading to the ripple.', '2005-07-01 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497634, 196234, 24212, '<td valign="top">A bright and colourful image, although I feel that the lines are not perhaps as strong as I might like. In addition, the foliage intruding on the right is a little distracting.</td>', 'A bright and colourful image, although I feel that the lines are not perhaps as strong as I might like. In addition, the foliage intruding on the right is a little distracting.', '2005-07-01 15:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497635, 196122, 6597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful place and the line leads the eye right into it</td>', 'This is a beautiful place and the line leads the eye right into it', '2005-07-01 15:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497636, 196151, 24212, '<td valign="top">Colourful and sharp, but perhaps a little more depth of field would be nice. So that, for instance, the main bloom is in focus over its entire width.</td>', 'Colourful and sharp, but perhaps a little more depth of field would be nice. So that, for instance, the main bloom is in focus over its entire width.', '2005-07-01 15:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497638, 196216, 24212, '<td valign="top">Far from the road to nowhere, it looks very much like the road to that mountain. My eye is really drawn in and I think that the cloud above is a masterstroke.</td>', 'Far from the road to nowhere, it looks very much like the road to that mountain. My eye is really drawn in and I think that the cloud above is a masterstroke.', '2005-07-01 15:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497640, 196321, 24212, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I''m being way too picky, but I don''t find any of the lines to be leading me anywhere. That said, this is a nice shot, although I find the motion blur in the wing a little annoying.</td>', 'Perhaps I''m being way too picky, but I don''t find any of the lines to be leading me anywhere. That said, this is a nice shot, although I find the motion blur in the wing a little annoying.', '2005-07-01 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497644, 195669, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting here and especially the pattern in the background (is it another fern or a printed backdrop? Either way it''s very subtly done and interesting)</td>', 'I really like the lighting here and especially the pattern in the background (is it another fern or a printed backdrop? Either way it''s very subtly done and interesting)', '2005-07-01 15:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497646, 196236, 24212, '<td valign="top">Good strong colours and interesting composition, although I''d prefer a bit more depth of field, so that the far side is in better focus.</td>', 'Good strong colours and interesting composition, although I''d prefer a bit more depth of field, so that the far side is in better focus.', '2005-07-01 15:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497648, 196363, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines really lead into the centre, but I find that, once there, the subject is a little indistinct.</td>', 'The lines really lead into the centre, but I find that, once there, the subject is a little indistinct.', '2005-07-01 15:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497651, 196208, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the composition and colour treatment are great, although perhaps I''d like to see more of the foreground in sharper focus.</td>', 'I think that the composition and colour treatment are great, although perhaps I''d like to see more of the foreground in sharper focus.', '2005-07-01 15:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497652, 195621, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp and the minaret really stands out against the sky.</td>', 'Nicely sharp and the minaret really stands out against the sky.', '2005-07-01 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497656, 195685, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I really like the way that lines include the footprints, water''s edge,clouds and tideline. The lines all lead to the lighthouse, which stands out well as a point of interest.</td>', 'Great composition, I really like the way that lines include the footprints, water''s edge,clouds and tideline. The lines all lead to the lighthouse, which stands out well as a point of interest.', '2005-07-01 15:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497658, 196402, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good idea, although I find the ball''s shadow a bit harsh and would like to see the ball a bit sharper.</td>', 'A good idea, although I find the ball''s shadow a bit harsh and would like to see the ball a bit sharper.', '2005-07-01 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497667, 196357, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clean and crisp, although I find that the centre section of page on the top might benefit from a little burning, as the lighting in that area seems a little flat.</td>', 'Very clean and crisp, although I find that the centre section of page on the top might benefit from a little burning, as the lighting in that area seems a little flat.', '2005-07-01 15:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497668, 194196, 12962, '<td valign="top">Terrific!  Coneflowers are my favorite to photograph ... the head is very complex and interesting.  Your colors are wonderful. Nine.</td>', 'Terrific!  Coneflowers are my favorite to photograph ... the head is very complex and interesting.  Your colors are wonderful. Nine.', '2005-07-01 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497670, 195678, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the greenery here is a little overpowering.</td>', 'I feel that the greenery here is a little overpowering.', '2005-07-01 15:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497675, 196263, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would have looked like if you had taken it from a viewpoint just a little higher? The line in the centre doesn''t look to me to be as strong as it possibly could be.</td>', 'I wonder what this would have looked like if you had taken it from a viewpoint just a little higher? The line in the centre doesn''t look to me to be as strong as it possibly could be.', '2005-07-01 15:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497676, 196181, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice detailed close up, although, for this particular challenge, I feel that the DOF might be a bit tight.</td>', 'A nice detailed close up, although, for this particular challenge, I feel that the DOF might be a bit tight.', '2005-07-01 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497678, 196425, 24212, '<td valign="top">You did well to capture that detail in the foreground. The line of light reflected on the ground helps reinforce the lines of the railings.</td>', 'You did well to capture that detail in the foreground. The line of light reflected on the ground helps reinforce the lines of the railings.', '2005-07-01 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497682, 196055, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and a good angle chosen, although perhaps the pedestrian is not far enough ''along'' the line of the path.</td>', 'Nice and sharp and a good angle chosen, although perhaps the pedestrian is not far enough ''along'' the line of the path.', '2005-07-01 15:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497684, 196403, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find that the foliage in the foreground detracts from the simplicity. Perhaps a little could be cropped off?</td>', 'I find that the foliage in the foreground detracts from the simplicity. Perhaps a little could be cropped off?', '2005-07-01 15:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497687, 196093, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful industrial as well as rural imagery.  Could be a stock photo.  But I also like that you''ve captured the towers to look like robots ... especially the far ones ... attacking each other.  The other thing that makes this photo very effective (at least to my eyes) is the leading line from left to right ... it is very natural for the eyes to follow a left to right line rather than the opposite ... and the fact that the line DOES lead to something (the group of towers at the back).   10.</td>', 'Beautiful industrial as well as rural imagery.  Could be a stock photo.  But I also like that you''ve captured the towers to look like robots ... especially the far ones ... attacking each other.  The other thing that makes this photo very effective (at least to my eyes) is the leading line from left to right ... it is very natural for the eyes to follow a left to right line rather than the opposite ... and the fact that the line DOES lead to something (the group of towers at the back).   10.', '2005-07-01 15:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497688, 196424, 12962, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting.', '2005-07-01 15:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497691, 195945, 24212, '<td valign="top">Bright and simple with lines leading strongly to the subject. There''s almost the sense of a story being told. Excellent.</td>', 'Bright and simple with lines leading strongly to the subject. There''s almost the sense of a story being told. Excellent.', '2005-07-01 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497698, 196181, 12962, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  DOF is good ... but some may say it''s too soft. Hope not.</td>', 'Sweet!  DOF is good ... but some may say it''s too soft. Hope not.', '2005-07-01 15:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497707, 196424, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting is just about perfect and the composition is fantastic. At first, I have to admit, I didn''t see the leading lines, but I think that the way that the stalks are pointing at the flower is really effective.</td>', 'The lighting is just about perfect and the composition is fantastic. At first, I have to admit, I didn''t see the leading lines, but I think that the way that the stalks are pointing at the flower is really effective.', '2005-07-01 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497709, 196394, 24212, '<td valign="top">I see strong lines and a strong subject, but I get no sense of one really leading to the other.</td>', 'I see strong lines and a strong subject, but I get no sense of one really leading to the other.', '2005-07-01 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497713, 193156, 24212, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to say that this might be better without the people in the frame, but upon reflection, I feel that they add rather than detract. Their inclusion gives some sense of life to what, otherwise, could be a rather sterile, if well executed, cityscape.</td>', 'At first I was going to say that this might be better without the people in the frame, but upon reflection, I feel that they add rather than detract. Their inclusion gives some sense of life to what, otherwise, could be a rather sterile, if well executed, cityscape.', '2005-07-01 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497715, 196229, 24212, '<td valign="top">Good, bold lines and great capture of the lighting.</td>', 'Good, bold lines and great capture of the lighting.', '2005-07-01 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497720, 196071, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, especially in the shadows, under the top. These lines lead well in to the photograph, but there seems to be subject matter lacking at the point of interest. Also, the photo seems to tilt to the right. I don''t know if it was intended, but it is distracting.</td>', 'Nice exposure, especially in the shadows, under the top. These lines lead well in to the photograph, but there seems to be subject matter lacking at the point of interest. Also, the photo seems to tilt to the right. I don''t know if it was intended, but it is distracting.', '2005-07-01 15:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497722, 195503, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the dreaminess in this shot, even though I''ve berated others where there lines look too soft. I like the way that the insect is positioned at an intersection. The whole frame seems to be pointing at it.</td>', 'I really like the dreaminess in this shot, even though I''ve berated others where there lines look too soft. I like the way that the insect is positioned at an intersection. The whole frame seems to be pointing at it.', '2005-07-01 15:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497723, 196367, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good, solid macro shot, although I get no real sense of lines leading me in.</td>', 'A good, solid macro shot, although I get no real sense of lines leading me in.', '2005-07-01 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497727, 195956, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that, perhaps, some of the foreground could be cropped away to give this a little more impact.</td>', 'I think that, perhaps, some of the foreground could be cropped away to give this a little more impact.', '2005-07-01 16:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497733, 194137, 24212, '<td valign="top">Some really strong lines in the clouds that seem to lead the eye towards the comparatively sharp edge of the cloud on the lower right.</td>', 'Some really strong lines in the clouds that seem to lead the eye towards the comparatively sharp edge of the cloud on the lower right.', '2005-07-01 16:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497736, 195903, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that perhaps I''d prefer to see the branches in sharper focus, as the trunk leads the eye upwards and when the viewer gets there, there is not as much detail as there could be.</td>', 'I think that perhaps I''d prefer to see the branches in sharper focus, as the trunk leads the eye upwards and when the viewer gets there, there is not as much detail as there could be.', '2005-07-01 16:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497738, 196073, 24212, '<td valign="top">Strong, simple lines and great lighting, but I can''t really see a focal point that the lines are leading me to.</td>', 'Strong, simple lines and great lighting, but I can''t really see a focal point that the lines are leading me to.', '2005-07-01 16:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497756, 193124, 31175, '<td valign="top">Super photo but not sure how well it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Super photo but not sure how well it meets the challenge.', '2005-07-01 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497766, 196277, 23053, '<td valign="top">The lighting here creates an unsettling feeling for me, and I have to say that your depth of field is rather astonishing.  Considering the challenge topic, I would expect to see something that my eyes are being led toward, say a person or an object, but I know that your intention was to lead my eye towards the indeterminate end of this catwalk, which seemingly goes on forever.  This is a good interpetation of the challenge, all in all.</td>', 'The lighting here creates an unsettling feeling for me, and I have to say that your depth of field is rather astonishing.  Considering the challenge topic, I would expect to see something that my eyes are being led toward, say a person or an object, but I know that your intention was to lead my eye towards the indeterminate end of this catwalk, which seemingly goes on forever.  This is a good interpetation of the challenge, all in all.', '2005-07-01 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497769, 194778, 37961, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The light, shadows and water break all work well together. Nicely Done.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The light, shadows and water break all work well together. Nicely Done.', '2005-07-01 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497774, 196312, 37961, '<td valign="top">Just getting familiar with infared photography, obviously some are better than others. This one is nice because of them being near the water/reflexion.</td>', 'Just getting familiar with infared photography, obviously some are better than others. This one is nice because of them being near the water/reflexion.', '2005-07-01 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497776, 196288, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like how the lines here seem to point to the curves of this woman''s body, which contrast well with the straight lines of the railing and the bench.  I''m kind of confused by your title, but that doesn''t matter.  The rotation of the shot is a little unusual to me, but that''s up to you, really.  Not bad at all.</td>', 'I like how the lines here seem to point to the curves of this woman''s body, which contrast well with the straight lines of the railing and the bench.  I''m kind of confused by your title, but that doesn''t matter.  The rotation of the shot is a little unusual to me, but that''s up to you, really.  Not bad at all.', '2005-07-01 16:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497777, 195954, 37961, '<td valign="top">Even though it was bleak. It has a certain charm to it. Like not being all blown out. I like it, and there are enough color tone/texture differences to give it dimension.</td>', 'Even though it was bleak. It has a certain charm to it. Like not being all blown out. I like it, and there are enough color tone/texture differences to give it dimension.', '2005-07-01 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497779, 196057, 37961, '<td valign="top">Zebras are often photographed but rarely in this way. I think you did a great job of incorporating the challenge into this shot. Bump high.</td>', 'Zebras are often photographed but rarely in this way. I think you did a great job of incorporating the challenge into this shot. Bump high.', '2005-07-01 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497781, 196210, 37961, '<td valign="top">The colors here are great. Almost making it abstract. I like it.</td>', 'The colors here are great. Almost making it abstract. I like it.', '2005-07-01 16:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497817, 196208, 15212, '<td valign="top">nice street photo, good use of selective desat. I hope it does well.</td>', 'nice street photo, good use of selective desat. I hope it does well.', '2005-07-01 16:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497819, 194778, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, though I wish the horizon were squared up. However, it doesn''t really speak to "leading lines" for me.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, though I wish the horizon were squared up. However, it doesn''t really speak to "leading lines" for me.', '2005-07-01 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497820, 193119, 15212, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines, but where are they leading to? There doesn''t really seem to be a main focus point. I find my eyes wandering around looking for something to hold my attention.</td>', 'Lots of lines, but where are they leading to? There doesn''t really seem to be a main focus point. I find my eyes wandering around looking for something to hold my attention.', '2005-07-01 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497824, 194202, 15212, '<td valign="top">I like your use of selective desat. to bring out your focus points, however I think the girl in the foreground competesfor attention that shouldn''t be on her.</td>', 'I like your use of selective desat. to bring out your focus points, however I think the girl in the foreground competesfor attention that shouldn''t be on her.', '2005-07-01 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497826, 196210, 30861, '<td valign="top">Boy that''s rich... I wish you''d squared up the verticals with a half degree or so ccw rotation. Strong entry. It''s perhaps more a "perspective" shot than a "leading lines" shot, but who''s picking nits? There aren''t that many "true" leading liens shots in the challenge anyway.</td>', 'Boy that''s rich... I wish you''d squared up the verticals with a half degree or so ccw rotation. Strong entry. It''s perhaps more a "perspective" shot than a "leading lines" shot, but who''s picking nits? There aren''t that many "true" leading liens shots in the challenge anyway.', '2005-07-01 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497831, 195675, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a seriously demented sky....</td>', 'That''s a seriously demented sky....', '2005-07-01 16:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497832, 196108, 19751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful interpretation of the challenge!! I would give it a 9 if I could vote :-)</td>', 'Wonderful interpretation of the challenge!! I would give it a 9 if I could vote :-)', '2005-07-01 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497833, 195748, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is quite spectacular. The double entendre on leading lines is proceless. technically the image is exceptionally well done. congrats.</td>', 'This is quite spectacular. The double entendre on leading lines is proceless. technically the image is exceptionally well done. congrats.', '2005-07-01 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497834, 196373, 30861, '<td valign="top">beautifully done B/W conversion.</td>', 'beautifully done B/W conversion.', '2005-07-01 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497835, 195503, 30861, '<td valign="top">sweeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeet. TRUE leading lines of a most subtle variety.</td>', 'sweeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeet. TRUE leading lines of a most subtle variety.', '2005-07-01 16:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497869, 194046, 24212, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot, although the foreground looks perhaps a little too bright and a touch oversharpened.</td>', 'A really nice shot, although the foreground looks perhaps a little too bright and a touch oversharpened.', '2005-07-01 17:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497870, 195496, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. I really like it. Thanks.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. I really like it. Thanks.', '2005-07-01 17:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497873, 194141, 24212, '<td valign="top">That''s a really purposeful expression.</td>', 'That''s a really purposeful expression.', '2005-07-01 17:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497875, 196391, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the crop is well chosen.Perhaps a touch greater depth of field would not go amiss.</td>', 'I think that the crop is well chosen.Perhaps a touch greater depth of field would not go amiss.', '2005-07-01 17:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497878, 195557, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines lead towards the centre really well and the simplicity is pleasant, although somewhat broken by the dots (vents, fixings, light fittings?) perhaps they could be cloned out.</td>', 'The lines lead towards the centre really well and the simplicity is pleasant, although somewhat broken by the dots (vents, fixings, light fittings?) perhaps they could be cloned out.', '2005-07-01 17:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497880, 195715, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great sharpness. Good composition.</td>', 'Very nice. Great sharpness. Good composition.', '2005-07-01 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497884, 196264, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the foreground could do with being a touch brighter. Also, perhaps the lighthouse could maybe be dodged a little bit to make it stand out from the sky a little more.</td>', 'I feel that the foreground could do with being a touch brighter. Also, perhaps the lighthouse could maybe be dodged a little bit to make it stand out from the sky a little more.', '2005-07-01 17:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497886, 196288, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines of the bench lead in to the subject really well and the subject is certainly very pleasant, although I feel that the pose looks a little uneasy.</td>', 'The lines of the bench lead in to the subject really well and the subject is certainly very pleasant, although I feel that the pose looks a little uneasy.', '2005-07-01 17:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497896, 196177, 19831, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I love humour in a photo. This one is not only funny, but done with style and executed quite well IMO. Nice. Thanks.</td>', 'Awesome. I love humour in a photo. This one is not only funny, but done with style and executed quite well IMO. Nice. Thanks.', '2005-07-01 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497925, 195946, 4793, '<td valign="top">nice close up</td>', 'nice close up', '2005-07-01 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497927, 195818, 4793, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2005-07-01 17:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497929, 195588, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2005-07-01 17:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497934, 196073, 4793, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-07-01 17:45:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1497937, 196426, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think this is Bow Bridge--I know it well--walk over it every weekend.  Nice Shot--good luck (8)</td>', 'I think this is Bow Bridge--I know it well--walk over it every weekend.  Nice Shot--good luck (8)', '2005-07-01 17:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497941, 196122, 4793, '<td valign="top">I agree this is a beautiful place, tell us the location, nice shot</td>', 'I agree this is a beautiful place, tell us the location, nice shot', '2005-07-01 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497942, 196169, 20115, '<td valign="top">very nice--one of my favorites so far</td>', 'very nice--one of my favorites so far', '2005-07-01 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497943, 196280, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2005-07-01 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497946, 196222, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-07-01 17:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497947, 196385, 24789, '<td valign="top">gee why does this look familiar, roflmao!!!!<br/></td>', 'gee why does this look familiar, roflmao!!!!', '2005-07-01 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497950, 195829, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors, excellent</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors, excellent', '2005-07-01 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497951, 196385, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-07-01 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497953, 195503, 31230, '<td valign="top">That is absolutely beautiful.  Great color</td>', 'That is absolutely beautiful.  Great color', '2005-07-01 17:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497955, 195818, 31230, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here.  I really like the b/w treatment.</td>', 'I like your idea here.  I really like the b/w treatment.', '2005-07-01 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497959, 195902, 31230, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a complete opposite of another image.  I really like this one better, but wish your line leading to the protestors was more prominent in the picture.</td>', 'Wow, what a complete opposite of another image.  I really like this one better, but wish your line leading to the protestors was more prominent in the picture.', '2005-07-01 17:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497962, 196211, 23053, '<td valign="top">Considering that the composition of this shot is basically centered, I would have liked to see you more centered in the patch for taking the shot.  You did line up over a mortar joint, but you are one joint off in my opinion.  Basically, if you want something to be centered, make sure it is centered, otherwise everyone will notice, even if just barely off.  If you want something to be off, make it enough of a break from center that people will know it was done purposefully...sorry to rant about this.  I do like the central idea of your shot, and I think it is mostly well executed.</td>', 'Considering that the composition of this shot is basically centered, I would have liked to see you more centered in the patch for taking the shot.  You did line up over a mortar joint, but you are one joint off in my opinion.  Basically, if you want something to be centered, make sure it is centered, otherwise everyone will notice, even if just barely off.  If you want something to be off, make it enough of a break from center that people will know it was done purposefully...sorry to rant about this.  I do like the central idea of your shot, and I think it is mostly well executed.', '2005-07-01 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497963, 195062, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the sepia, light, and sharpness here. For me, the top lines are leading lines, because my is drawn from the top down into the cross of the electric pole, and then out the left side of the picture. I do wish the camera could''ve been tilted upwards a little to remove the lower three power lines, though. Overall, nice entry!</td>', 'Nice job with the sepia, light, and sharpness here. For me, the top lines are leading lines, because my is drawn from the top down into the cross of the electric pole, and then out the left side of the picture. I do wish the camera could''ve been tilted upwards a little to remove the lower three power lines, though. Overall, nice entry!', '2005-07-01 17:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497964, 195710, 3087, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful image... a lovely sky, stunning sun and absolutely perfect composition. However, though I''m not normally one of the "does not meet the challenge" brigade, this just doesn''t conform even vaguely to my understanding of leading lines as a composition tool so it''s not scoring as highly as it would in a challenge where I felt it met the theme better.</td>', 'Such a beautiful image... a lovely sky, stunning sun and absolutely perfect composition. However, though I''m not normally one of the "does not meet the challenge" brigade, this just doesn''t conform even vaguely to my understanding of leading lines as a composition tool so it''s not scoring as highly as it would in a challenge where I felt it met the theme better.', '2005-07-01 17:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497967, 196422, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-07-01 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497968, 196312, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like this! This effect is great here. The reflections are beautiful and I like how clean everything (including the sky) is.</td>', 'Ooh, I like this! This effect is great here. The reflections are beautiful and I like how clean everything (including the sky) is.', '2005-07-01 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497970, 196338, 31230, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!!</td>', 'Outstanding!!!', '2005-07-01 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497973, 194324, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greens</td>', 'Beautiful greens', '2005-07-01 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497975, 195285, 31133, '<td valign="top">This looks like a little toy bridge. Nice and sharp on the subject - good subtle colors in the background, too.</td>', 'This looks like a little toy bridge. Nice and sharp on the subject - good subtle colors in the background, too.', '2005-07-01 18:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497977, 195604, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I followed these lines and was pleasantly surprised to find something at the end other than the end of the leaf.  Beautiful image and nice title</td>', 'Nicely done.  I followed these lines and was pleasantly surprised to find something at the end other than the end of the leaf.  Beautiful image and nice title', '2005-07-01 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497979, 195270, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Color, contrast, clean-ness, ... everything.</td>', 'Fantastic! Color, contrast, clean-ness, ... everything.', '2005-07-01 18:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497981, 195531, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like this...it is a bit freaky since your back looks like it is smiling at me in a very menacing way, but all in all, it''s a cool shot.  The tones are great.  I don''t like your subject almost looks pasted onto the background, but it does add a bit of depth to the shot.  And, while the back is cool, the fingers are the most interesting part to me.  I don''t see strong leading lines, but all the same, this is...cool.</td>', 'I like this...it is a bit freaky since your back looks like it is smiling at me in a very menacing way, but all in all, it''s a cool shot.  The tones are great.  I don''t like your subject almost looks pasted onto the background, but it does add a bit of depth to the shot.  And, while the back is cool, the fingers are the most interesting part to me.  I don''t see strong leading lines, but all the same, this is...cool.', '2005-07-01 18:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497982, 195902, 3087, '<td valign="top">Because this was clearly defined as a technique based challenge, this one doesn''t fit the challenge well for me. It''s not really using the compositional tool of leading lines. Instead it seems to be to be taking the challenge title only and ignoring the description and representing the idea of leading lines conceptually. In that sense I like it, I think it''s a great candid image, I think your decision to go for black and white is right and your chosen crop works. But I don''t feel it meets this challenge that well so I''m not scoring it as highly as I might in another challenge where it met the challenge better in my eyes.</td>', 'Because this was clearly defined as a technique based challenge, this one doesn''t fit the challenge well for me. It''s not really using the compositional tool of leading lines. Instead it seems to be to be taking the challenge title only and ignoring the description and representing the idea of leading lines conceptually. In that sense I like it, I think it''s a great candid image, I think your decision to go for black and white is right and your chosen crop works. But I don''t feel it meets this challenge that well so I''m not scoring it as highly as I might in another challenge where it met the challenge better in my eyes.', '2005-07-01 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497991, 192787, 35746, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot of a dragonfly. i find these to be one of gods wackiest creatures along with giraffes</td>', 'this is a great shot of a dragonfly. i find these to be one of gods wackiest creatures along with giraffes', '2005-07-01 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498007, 196102, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful aura of calm and serenity to this shot. I can almost imagine being on the phone in a tunnel such as this and speaking to someone I love and that discussion being so central to me that everything around me falls silent in my head and I hardly notice the details... A great image! 10</td>', 'Wonderful aura of calm and serenity to this shot. I can almost imagine being on the phone in a tunnel such as this and speaking to someone I love and that discussion being so central to me that everything around me falls silent in my head and I hardly notice the details... A great image! 10', '2005-07-01 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498009, 196114, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot... I have always adored reading so this representation of reading in a dreamlike way resonates strongly with me. Also I love the play of light and shadow, the sense of distance and yet closeness and the feeling of intimacy. 10</td>', 'What a fantastic shot... I have always adored reading so this representation of reading in a dreamlike way resonates strongly with me. Also I love the play of light and shadow, the sense of distance and yet closeness and the feeling of intimacy. 10', '2005-07-01 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498017, 196287, 3087, '<td valign="top">I just ADORE the vivid colours of the waterside moss/ lichen against the darkness of the shrubbery further from the water''s edge. The meandering of the blue water draws a lovely path through the image and the skyline and sky are both just spot on. Those lenticular clouds are just the perfect, slightly surreal backdrop to the almost alient quality of the foreground! 10</td>', 'I just ADORE the vivid colours of the waterside moss/ lichen against the darkness of the shrubbery further from the water''s edge. The meandering of the blue water draws a lovely path through the image and the skyline and sky are both just spot on. Those lenticular clouds are just the perfect, slightly surreal backdrop to the almost alient quality of the foreground! 10', '2005-07-01 18:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498020, 196180, 30625, '<td valign="top">Great choice of location. The swooping makes you wonder whats round the corner. Very well shot. (8) I wish your would have done more with the sky</td>', 'Great choice of location. The swooping makes you wonder whats round the corner. Very well shot. (8) I wish your would have done more with the sky', '2005-07-01 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498025, 196426, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the off-kilter composition of this. I also like the way the bridge is so heavy and imposing, the way it swoops up into a hump, the texture of the surface and the exact positioning of the lone figure. The light falling on him just so makes him a perfect focal point and the blackness of the background is so unexpected it adds an element of surreality to it all. 9</td>', 'I love the off-kilter composition of this. I also like the way the bridge is so heavy and imposing, the way it swoops up into a hump, the texture of the surface and the exact positioning of the lone figure. The light falling on him just so makes him a perfect focal point and the blackness of the background is so unexpected it adds an element of surreality to it all. 9', '2005-07-01 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498026, 196095, 30625, '<td valign="top">The composition is just perfect. The leading lines really hit the spot. As for the color the just excellent.</td>', 'The composition is just perfect. The leading lines really hit the spot. As for the color the just excellent.', '2005-07-01 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498032, 196205, 30625, '<td valign="top">I just cant figure out what is really going on in this shot. I assume those dark elements are clouds. The rest I just cant figure out.</td>', 'I just cant figure out what is really going on in this shot. I assume those dark elements are clouds. The rest I just cant figure out.', '2005-07-01 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498036, 195792, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking centred composition and great use of light, shade and shape. That lone tree seems so frail against the onslaught of what seem like such heavy and menacing clouds and yet it''s illuminated by gentle and golden rays. I don''t like that line of light at the edge of distant clouds at the lower left and would clone it out myself as it leads my focus away from the wonderful tree. 9</td>', 'Striking centred composition and great use of light, shade and shape. That lone tree seems so frail against the onslaught of what seem like such heavy and menacing clouds and yet it''s illuminated by gentle and golden rays. I don''t like that line of light at the edge of distant clouds at the lower left and would clone it out myself as it leads my focus away from the wonderful tree. 9', '2005-07-01 18:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498041, 196424, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most striking and subtle uses of lighting I have come across and I love the way the merest touch of light along the stems creates strong lines that curve and then point at the flower itself. Just magical! 10</td>', 'This is one of the most striking and subtle uses of lighting I have come across and I love the way the merest touch of light along the stems creates strong lines that curve and then point at the flower itself. Just magical! 10', '2005-07-01 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498053, 196254, 3087, '<td valign="top">In terms of the challenge theme, this is one of the strongest contenders. Those lines are so strong and lead so effectively to an object that actually has interest and serves as an excellent focal point. I really iike the grittiness inherent in it and the darkness too. Black and white is essential to that. Composition rocks too. 10</td>', 'In terms of the challenge theme, this is one of the strongest contenders. Those lines are so strong and lead so effectively to an object that actually has interest and serves as an excellent focal point. I really iike the grittiness inherent in it and the darkness too. Black and white is essential to that. Composition rocks too. 10', '2005-07-01 18:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498064, 196208, 3087, '<td valign="top">Glad you chose this one, it''s one of the ones I liked  lot. I love the shallow DOF in the foreground and the way the entire foreground is full of leading lines sweeping into the image. The curve of the tunnel roof makes a great frame to the image and the tunnel opening is the perfect main focal point. That said I like that there''s more to look at such as the people, signs and posters too. Selective desat is a technique that is often over-used but here it works fantastically well. 9</td>', 'Glad you chose this one, it''s one of the ones I liked  lot. I love the shallow DOF in the foreground and the way the entire foreground is full of leading lines sweeping into the image. The curve of the tunnel roof makes a great frame to the image and the tunnel opening is the perfect main focal point. That said I like that there''s more to look at such as the people, signs and posters too. Selective desat is a technique that is often over-used but here it works fantastically well. 9', '2005-07-01 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498127, 194839, 29557, '<td valign="top">good shot, lines leading me everywhere. the light gradient kind of throws the pic off.</td>', 'good shot, lines leading me everywhere. the light gradient kind of throws the pic off.', '2005-07-01 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
