(1498192, 196385, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I bet that the happy couple would be delighted with a shot like this. By the way, couldn''t you have cloned out the rival photographer?</td>', 'Very well done. I bet that the happy couple would be delighted with a shot like this. By the way, couldn''t you have cloned out the rival photographer?', '2005-07-01 19:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
