(1499074, 195094, 24212, '<td valign="top">Bold colours and strong lines, but I cannot really see them leading anywhere in particular.</td>', 'Bold colours and strong lines, but I cannot really see them leading anywhere in particular.', '2005-07-02 03:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499075, 195990, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, although I find the shadows of the strings to be a little confusing.</td>', 'Nicely done, although I find the shadows of the strings to be a little confusing.', '2005-07-02 03:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499078, 195704, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, with great colour and contrast. One small, almost irrelevant, niggle: perhaps you could have cloned out the gull and the small wisp of cloud. To me, they seem to draw my eye away from the main line in the picture.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, with great colour and contrast. One small, almost irrelevant, niggle: perhaps you could have cloned out the gull and the small wisp of cloud. To me, they seem to draw my eye away from the main line in the picture.', '2005-07-02 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499080, 196339, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I feel that the lighting is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'A good idea, but I feel that the lighting is a bit too harsh.', '2005-07-02 03:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499083, 196198, 24212, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot of the canal (I like the inclusion of the river below as a counterpoint to the straightness of the canal), but I feel that the path on the left is a little too dominant and leads my eye straight past the narrow boat. Could you perhaps try cropping the fence on the left completely off?</td>', 'An interesting shot of the canal (I like the inclusion of the river below as a counterpoint to the straightness of the canal), but I feel that the path on the left is a little too dominant and leads my eye straight past the narrow boat. Could you perhaps try cropping the fence on the left completely off?', '2005-07-02 03:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499085, 195062, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sky behind is very dramatic. Good capture. Just a note, a couple of the lines are a bit blurred towards the edge of the frame. I feel that, in this type of shot, that I''d really like to see them all sharp.</td>', 'The sky behind is very dramatic. Good capture. Just a note, a couple of the lines are a bit blurred towards the edge of the frame. I feel that, in this type of shot, that I''d really like to see them all sharp.', '2005-07-02 03:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499089, 196274, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good texture shot, but I feel that it might need a little more contrast and sharpness to really ''pop''.</td>', 'A good texture shot, but I feel that it might need a little more contrast and sharpness to really ''pop''.', '2005-07-02 03:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499091, 195705, 13688, '<td valign="top">good line.  i wish the smoke was following it into the image instead of drawing my attention off of the page</td>', 'good line.  i wish the smoke was following it into the image instead of drawing my attention off of the page', '2005-07-02 03:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499093, 195597, 24212, '<td valign="top">The line here really leads in to the train: I almost feel that it''s coming out of the frame at me. However, the locomotive itself looks to be a little soft (perhaps your focus point was in front of it) and the sky looks a little over-processed. I find that these two things spoil the effect a little.</td>', 'The line here really leads in to the train: I almost feel that it''s coming out of the frame at me. However, the locomotive itself looks to be a little soft (perhaps your focus point was in front of it) and the sky looks a little over-processed. I find that these two things spoil the effect a little.', '2005-07-02 03:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499094, 196318, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really feel that this could do with some additional sharpening to make it stand out.</td>', 'I really feel that this could do with some additional sharpening to make it stand out.', '2005-07-02 03:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499095, 194777, 13688, '<td valign="top">strong border.  i feel it really draws out your background objects.  I wish there was only that 1 house at the end of the rows to choose from as the ones on the right seem extraneous and distracting.</td>', 'strong border.  i feel it really draws out your background objects.  I wish there was only that 1 house at the end of the rows to choose from as the ones on the right seem extraneous and distracting.', '2005-07-02 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499097, 196269, 24212, '<td valign="top">Clever composition. The depth of field looks to have been controlled excellently.</td>', 'Clever composition. The depth of field looks to have been controlled excellently.', '2005-07-02 03:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499098, 193047, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the mist. I find that hard to do (OK, I find getting up early enough in the morning hard to do).</td>', 'I like the capture of the mist. I find that hard to do (OK, I find getting up early enough in the morning hard to do).', '2005-07-02 03:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499102, 196209, 24212, '<td valign="top">I must confess that I didn''t like this at first viewing, but I quite like it now. The expression captured is great, the composition is good and the lines from the whiskers really lead in.</td>', 'I must confess that I didn''t like this at first viewing, but I quite like it now. The expression captured is great, the composition is good and the lines from the whiskers really lead in.', '2005-07-02 03:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499104, 195820, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting pic.  you cover a tremendous amount of ground in it, between fore, middle, and back.  unfortunately they each feel very distinct to me and it doesn''t feel like it meets a leading line challenge as your subject to my eye is the big building in the middle ground.  nonetheless, i really like your choice of toning.</td>', 'very interesting pic.  you cover a tremendous amount of ground in it, between fore, middle, and back.  unfortunately they each feel very distinct to me and it doesn''t feel like it meets a leading line challenge as your subject to my eye is the big building in the middle ground.  nonetheless, i really like your choice of toning.', '2005-07-02 03:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499105, 196309, 24212, '<td valign="top">Well lit (perhaps just a hint more light on the left-most bloom) and a pleasant enough arrangement, although the lines don''t really seem to draw my eye along.</td>', 'Well lit (perhaps just a hint more light on the left-most bloom) and a pleasant enough arrangement, although the lines don''t really seem to draw my eye along.', '2005-07-02 03:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499108, 196145, 24212, '<td valign="top">An intriguing ''slice of life''. It''s also nice and sharp, but I feel that the rocks on the floor up against the wall on the left might be a little too bright.</td>', 'An intriguing ''slice of life''. It''s also nice and sharp, but I feel that the rocks on the floor up against the wall on the left might be a little too bright.', '2005-07-02 03:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499109, 196379, 13688, '<td valign="top">very dynamic pic.  great lighting.  that space on the right grabs a ton of my attention, kind of breaking your line.  still a very cool shot</td>', 'very dynamic pic.  great lighting.  that space on the right grabs a ton of my attention, kind of breaking your line.  still a very cool shot', '2005-07-02 03:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499111, 195597, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the angle.  way to get in on the action.  maybe a little more contrast would help the drama of the scene</td>', 'i like the angle.  way to get in on the action.  maybe a little more contrast would help the drama of the scene', '2005-07-02 03:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499112, 195820, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted, but I feel that perhaps the cityscape behind draws one''s attention away from the lines that should be leading one in to the subject. Have you tried cropping down from the top to the roofline, or thereabouts, of the houses?</td>', 'Nicely spotted, but I feel that perhaps the cityscape behind draws one''s attention away from the lines that should be leading one in to the subject. Have you tried cropping down from the top to the roofline, or thereabouts, of the houses?', '2005-07-02 03:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499115, 196398, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines are strong, although I get no sense of them leading me anywhere.</td>', 'The lines are strong, although I get no sense of them leading me anywhere.', '2005-07-02 03:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499118, 195269, 24212, '<td valign="top">It looks as though lighting condtions were a bit difficult - the sky looks to be a bit blown. The eye is certainly drawn in here, although I feel that the view through the arch at the end could perhaps be a little darker or brighter, so as to make it stnd out. The off-centre approach to the view along the corridor (cloister?) works well here.</td>', 'It looks as though lighting condtions were a bit difficult - the sky looks to be a bit blown. The eye is certainly drawn in here, although I feel that the view through the arch at the end could perhaps be a little darker or brighter, so as to make it stnd out. The off-centre approach to the view along the corridor (cloister?) works well here.', '2005-07-02 03:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499121, 196283, 24212, '<td valign="top">Plenty of lines leading in, although I find the subject to be a little uninvolving.</td>', 'Plenty of lines leading in, although I find the subject to be a little uninvolving.', '2005-07-02 03:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499123, 195229, 13688, '<td valign="top">great lighting and colors.  i want to really like this pic even though the line really runs off the page...i''m still very much drawn to your focal point the door knob.  the angle not being straight on just makes me uncomfortable...not sure exactly why.</td>', 'great lighting and colors.  i want to really like this pic even though the line really runs off the page...i''m still very much drawn to your focal point the door knob.  the angle not being straight on just makes me uncomfortable...not sure exactly why.', '2005-07-02 03:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499126, 195748, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea indeed. I do feel, however, that a little bit of sharpening could be applied to the subject, as she looks to be a little soft in comparison with the sharp lettering.</td>', 'A very clever idea indeed. I do feel, however, that a little bit of sharpening could be applied to the subject, as she looks to be a little soft in comparison with the sharp lettering.', '2005-07-02 03:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499129, 196426, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lughting and great composition. The only flaw I can possibly find is that there is a small white dot near the lower right corner that could, perhaps, be cloned out.</td>', 'Wonderful lughting and great composition. The only flaw I can possibly find is that there is a small white dot near the lower right corner that could, perhaps, be cloned out.', '2005-07-02 03:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499132, 193124, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the folded wings draw the viewer to the butterfly''s (moth''s?) head, while the whole is underlined by the leaf.</td>', 'I like the way that the folded wings draw the viewer to the butterfly''s (moth''s?) head, while the whole is underlined by the leaf.', '2005-07-02 03:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499133, 196177, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very clever shot, although perhaps I''d like to see a little more of the rails in the foreground.</td>', 'A very clever shot, although perhaps I''d like to see a little more of the rails in the foreground.', '2005-07-02 03:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499135, 196122, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasant enough view, although I feel that it might need a little sharpening to really make it stand out.</td>', 'This is a pleasant enough view, although I feel that it might need a little sharpening to really make it stand out.', '2005-07-02 03:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499137, 196348, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the line leading up and through the frame, although I feel that a bit more contrast and sharpening would make this ''pop'' a bit more.</td>', 'I like the line leading up and through the frame, although I feel that a bit more contrast and sharpening would make this ''pop'' a bit more.', '2005-07-02 04:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499146, 196254, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m sure that the grain won''t be to everyones''s taste, but I think it adds to the mood. Overall this may be a little dark on some peoples screens (looks perfect on my LCD)  Excellent.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m sure that the grain won''t be to everyones''s taste, but I think it adds to the mood. Overall this may be a little dark on some peoples screens (looks perfect on my LCD)  Excellent.', '2005-07-02 04:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
