(1499585, 192816, 24212, '<td valign="top">The line leading through the frame is quite strong, although there seems to be quite a bluish cast to the whole photo.</td>', 'The line leading through the frame is quite strong, although there seems to be quite a bluish cast to the whole photo.', '2005-07-02 10:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499589, 194315, 24212, '<td valign="top">It would be pretty hard to miss at that range, wouldn''t it? I think that the smoke is a good addition.</td>', 'It would be pretty hard to miss at that range, wouldn''t it? I think that the smoke is a good addition.', '2005-07-02 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499591, 196155, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that some of the highlights here are a little too strong.</td>', 'I think that some of the highlights here are a little too strong.', '2005-07-02 10:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499592, 194324, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines indeed, but I don''t really feel that they lead me to anything in particular. Other than that, this is a pleasantly-composed shot.</td>', 'Lots of lines indeed, but I don''t really feel that they lead me to anything in particular. Other than that, this is a pleasantly-composed shot.', '2005-07-02 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499593, 192708, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like the muted colours.</td>', 'I quite like the muted colours.', '2005-07-02 10:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499596, 195937, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture, you caught this at just the right moment and there is just enough of the lane dividers to to the right of the frame to draw the eye to the subject. I''d perhaps be a little worried about using my camera in a humid environment such as a swimming pool.</td>', 'This is a great capture, you caught this at just the right moment and there is just enough of the lane dividers to to the right of the frame to draw the eye to the subject. I''d perhaps be a little worried about using my camera in a humid environment such as a swimming pool.', '2005-07-02 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499597, 195675, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the roadside on the left of the frame draws the eye away from the rest of the frame. Perhaps it could be darkened somewhat.</td>', 'I think that the roadside on the left of the frame draws the eye away from the rest of the frame. Perhaps it could be darkened somewhat.', '2005-07-02 11:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499598, 196285, 24212, '<td valign="top">I guess that it was quite dark inside and quite bright outside. Well done for getting lots of texture in the wood and retaining some details in the portion beyond the door.</td>', 'I guess that it was quite dark inside and quite bright outside. Well done for getting lots of texture in the wood and retaining some details in the portion beyond the door.', '2005-07-02 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499602, 196098, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could do with some more sharpening and perhaps a little toning down of some of the highlights.</td>', 'I feel that this could do with some more sharpening and perhaps a little toning down of some of the highlights.', '2005-07-02 11:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499603, 196166, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that you''ve captured this with the shadows of the handrails falling onto the platform. You must have waited for just the right time.</td>', 'I like the way that you''ve captured this with the shadows of the handrails falling onto the platform. You must have waited for just the right time.', '2005-07-02 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499605, 195666, 24212, '<td valign="top">All things lead towards the guy in the tie, don''t they? The lines, the small, subdued patch of colour and the blurring of the other people. I think that this is extremely well done.</td>', 'All things lead towards the guy in the tie, don''t they? The lines, the small, subdued patch of colour and the blurring of the other people. I think that this is extremely well done.', '2005-07-02 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499607, 196297, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the depth of field is absolutely spot on here. The barbed wire on the right is sharp, creating lines leading to the sheep, while the wire in front of the sheep is out of focus, so that it doesn''t detract from the subject.</td>', 'I think that the depth of field is absolutely spot on here. The barbed wire on the right is sharp, creating lines leading to the sheep, while the wire in front of the sheep is out of focus, so that it doesn''t detract from the subject.', '2005-07-02 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499610, 196358, 24212, '<td valign="top">Everything indeed leads into the centre, although I feel that the main point of the photo is not as sharp as it could be and I find myself straining to discern exactly what it might be.</td>', 'Everything indeed leads into the centre, although I feel that the main point of the photo is not as sharp as it could be and I find myself straining to discern exactly what it might be.', '2005-07-02 11:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499617, 195792, 24212, '<td valign="top">The tree makes a good silhouette against the rays of light. I feel that there are a couple of bright spots on the ground in the bottom right that could be cloned out.</td>', 'The tree makes a good silhouette against the rays of light. I feel that there are a couple of bright spots on the ground in the bottom right that could be cloned out.', '2005-07-02 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499620, 196443, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a good night shot with some strong lines. I do feel, however, that it might look even better with the two road signs cloned out.</td>', 'I think that this is a good night shot with some strong lines. I do feel, however, that it might look even better with the two road signs cloned out.', '2005-07-02 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499621, 194321, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the rather high-key approach works well here.</td>', 'I think that the rather high-key approach works well here.', '2005-07-02 11:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499623, 196262, 24212, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, although I feel that a little extra sharpening might not go amiss.</td>', 'Strong lines, although I feel that a little extra sharpening might not go amiss.', '2005-07-02 11:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499624, 196222, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great texture and the lines really lead to the subject.</td>', 'Great texture and the lines really lead to the subject.', '2005-07-02 11:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499625, 193041, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that you''ve chosen your angle, so that the lines converge so well.</td>', 'I like the way that you''ve chosen your angle, so that the lines converge so well.', '2005-07-02 11:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499627, 195902, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good study and very crisp, but I get no real sense of any lines leading in.</td>', 'A good study and very crisp, but I get no real sense of any lines leading in.', '2005-07-02 11:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499630, 196296, 24212, '<td valign="top">There seem to be some spots of dust in the in-focus portion of the picture. Perhaps these could be cloned out, as I feel that simplicity is a strong point here and the dust spoils that a bit.</td>', 'There seem to be some spots of dust in the in-focus portion of the picture. Perhaps these could be cloned out, as I feel that simplicity is a strong point here and the dust spoils that a bit.', '2005-07-02 11:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499632, 196400, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the selective desaturation does not work quite as well here as it often does. The colours seem to jump out a little bit too much.</td>', 'I feel that the selective desaturation does not work quite as well here as it often does. The colours seem to jump out a little bit too much.', '2005-07-02 11:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499636, 196011, 24212, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to make a comment about this needing some sharpening, but the longer I look at this, the more I like it as it is.There''s plenty to draw the eye in here.</td>', 'At first I was going to make a comment about this needing some sharpening, but the longer I look at this, the more I like it as it is.There''s plenty to draw the eye in here.', '2005-07-02 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499637, 196428, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the highlight on the neck to be a little overpowering.</td>', 'I find the highlight on the neck to be a little overpowering.', '2005-07-02 11:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499639, 192712, 24212, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The lines really lead to the subject.</td>', 'Excellent composition. The lines really lead to the subject.', '2005-07-02 11:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499640, 196152, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that perhaps this is a little too bright and might bear a little sharpening.</td>', 'I think that perhaps this is a little too bright and might bear a little sharpening.', '2005-07-02 11:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499643, 196117, 24212, '<td valign="top">Often I feel that the inclusion of quite a lot of foreground is unnecessary, but here I feel that it really helps. The viewer gets the juxtaposition of the boy rooted on the ground and the kite flying in the air.</td>', 'Often I feel that the inclusion of quite a lot of foreground is unnecessary, but here I feel that it really helps. The viewer gets the juxtaposition of the boy rooted on the ground and the kite flying in the air.', '2005-07-02 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499644, 196287, 24212, '<td valign="top">Although the greens look a shade unnatural, they really help strengthen the lines, which lead firmly to the hills and that wonderful cloud.</td>', 'Although the greens look a shade unnatural, they really help strengthen the lines, which lead firmly to the hills and that wonderful cloud.', '2005-07-02 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499648, 194746, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the bright sky really helps here.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the bright sky really helps here.', '2005-07-02 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499650, 196071, 24212, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a little off-centre and leaning to the right. I find myself leaning over in my chair to look at it.</td>', 'This looks to be a little off-centre and leaning to the right. I find myself leaning over in my chair to look at it.', '2005-07-02 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499651, 196224, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the path really leads the eye to the monument, although that seems a bit too bright to me.</td>', 'I like the way that the path really leads the eye to the monument, although that seems a bit too bright to me.', '2005-07-02 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499652, 196434, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lots of texture, although I don''t really get the feel that all these lines are leading my eye anywhere.</td>', 'Lots of texture, although I don''t really get the feel that all these lines are leading my eye anywhere.', '2005-07-02 11:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499655, 196329, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think you have chosen a very good viewpoint here.</td>', 'I think you have chosen a very good viewpoint here.', '2005-07-02 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499657, 196227, 24212, '<td valign="top">I know that all the spokes lead to the hub, but I find that, as they cross, the effect of them leading anywhere (visually at least) is lost.</td>', 'I know that all the spokes lead to the hub, but I find that, as they cross, the effect of them leading anywhere (visually at least) is lost.', '2005-07-02 11:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499658, 196108, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the atmospheric perspective created here. The mountains and sky are wonderfully texture-rich and the road really draws the eye in.</td>', 'I love the atmospheric perspective created here. The mountains and sky are wonderfully texture-rich and the road really draws the eye in.', '2005-07-02 11:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499660, 194861, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colour used here and I like the photo, although I get no immediate feel of lines leading me in.</td>', 'I like the colour used here and I like the photo, although I get no immediate feel of lines leading me in.', '2005-07-02 11:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499664, 195946, 24212, '<td valign="top">You seem to have got the exposure spot on here - it''s normally all too easy to completely blow out white feathers.</td>', 'You seem to have got the exposure spot on here - it''s normally all too easy to completely blow out white feathers.', '2005-07-02 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499665, 196338, 24212, '<td valign="top">Did you get your feet wet doing this?</td>', 'Did you get your feet wet doing this?', '2005-07-02 11:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499666, 196268, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the detail and the way that the eye is drawn in by the archway to the dome.</td>', 'I love the detail and the way that the eye is drawn in by the archway to the dome.', '2005-07-02 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499668, 196383, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good sense of perspective here, particularly in the mountains.</td>', 'A good sense of perspective here, particularly in the mountains.', '2005-07-02 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499669, 195664, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could do with a bit of extra sharpening to bring out the detail.</td>', 'I feel that this could do with a bit of extra sharpening to bring out the detail.', '2005-07-02 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499671, 195781, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the brooding sky. It seems to fit really rather well with the stark lines of the bridge.</td>', 'I like the brooding sky. It seems to fit really rather well with the stark lines of the bridge.', '2005-07-02 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499674, 196169, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully well-observed. Not only does the path lead to the subject, so do the patterns in the cobbles and the edge of the shadows. A bit of a pity about the foliage intruding into the lower left, but even that is pointing at the subject. My first reaction when I saw this was to smile at the simplicity and elegance of it.</td>', 'This is wonderfully well-observed. Not only does the path lead to the subject, so do the patterns in the cobbles and the edge of the shadows. A bit of a pity about the foliage intruding into the lower left, but even that is pointing at the subject. My first reaction when I saw this was to smile at the simplicity and elegance of it.', '2005-07-02 11:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499678, 196205, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is, perhaps, a little too abstract for my tastes.</td>', 'This is, perhaps, a little too abstract for my tastes.', '2005-07-02 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499679, 195744, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very striking image indeed. I just wish that the rays of light were a little stronger.</td>', 'A very striking image indeed. I just wish that the rays of light were a little stronger.', '2005-07-02 11:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499681, 195523, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting and eposure are great, the texture in the hull is almost tangible and the lines really lead into the frame. I like it a lot.</td>', 'The lighting and eposure are great, the texture in the hull is almost tangible and the lines really lead into the frame. I like it a lot.', '2005-07-02 11:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499684, 196251, 24212, '<td valign="top">An interesting image with lots of strong lines, although I don''t find them leading me in any particular direction.</td>', 'An interesting image with lots of strong lines, although I don''t find them leading me in any particular direction.', '2005-07-02 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499689, 194142, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lines lead to the post, which is also the only element in focus. Good technique. If only the post was more interesting to look at, this would be a nice photo.</td>', 'The lines lead to the post, which is also the only element in focus. Good technique. If only the post was more interesting to look at, this would be a nice photo.', '2005-07-02 11:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499703, 195417, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the way the eye is lead from the petals to the base of the stamens then up to the anthers. I wish they were in sharper focus, but this is still a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I like the way the eye is lead from the petals to the base of the stamens then up to the anthers. I wish they were in sharper focus, but this is still a beautiful photo.', '2005-07-02 12:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499712, 195903, 10402, '<td valign="top">All the lines lead to where the fronds extend from the trunk. This photo would be a lot more interesting if that point was in focus.</td>', 'All the lines lead to where the fronds extend from the trunk. This photo would be a lot more interesting if that point was in focus.', '2005-07-02 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499715, 195940, 10402, '<td valign="top">Lots of leading lines, but they lead to the very edge of the photo, which isn''t the interesting part.</td>', 'Lots of leading lines, but they lead to the very edge of the photo, which isn''t the interesting part.', '2005-07-02 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499717, 195993, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and lines, but lacks a center of interest.</td>', 'Interesting textures and lines, but lacks a center of interest.', '2005-07-02 12:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499722, 196424, 10402, '<td valign="top">The sinuous  lines beckon the eye to follow them. And they all lead to the center of interest, which is also the brightest element in the photo. Very nice. It would be even better if the flower was more sharply focused.</td>', 'The sinuous  lines beckon the eye to follow them. And they all lead to the center of interest, which is also the brightest element in the photo. Very nice. It would be even better if the flower was more sharply focused.', '2005-07-02 12:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499724, 196357, 10402, '<td valign="top">A lot of lines, but where do they lead?</td>', 'A lot of lines, but where do they lead?', '2005-07-02 12:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499728, 195724, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines. Composition is too centered; try cropping off the bottom to follow the "rule of thirds". Focus is terrible; it looks like the camera focused on the clouds rather than the foreground. Sharpening won''t fix poor focus; it just puts halos around the dark objects (most evident at the tops of the fence posts).</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines. Composition is too centered; try cropping off the bottom to follow the "rule of thirds". Focus is terrible; it looks like the camera focused on the clouds rather than the foreground. Sharpening won''t fix poor focus; it just puts halos around the dark objects (most evident at the tops of the fence posts).', '2005-07-02 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499756, 196102, 259, '<td valign="top">easily my favorite shot.  one of the better pictures i''ve seen in the challenges in a while.</td>', 'easily my favorite shot.  one of the better pictures i''ve seen in the challenges in a while.', '2005-07-02 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499760, 196227, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the composition.  the angle you used really makes the wheel seem larger than life.</td>', 'i really like the composition.  the angle you used really makes the wheel seem larger than life.', '2005-07-02 13:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499761, 196426, 259, '<td valign="top">you''ve got an excellent mood to your shot.</td>', 'you''ve got an excellent mood to your shot.', '2005-07-02 13:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499764, 192712, 259, '<td valign="top">easily one of the best shots in the challenge.  the girl is key, without her it wouldn''t be nearly as powerfull.</td>', 'easily one of the best shots in the challenge.  the girl is key, without her it wouldn''t be nearly as powerfull.', '2005-07-02 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499767, 196210, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice bold coloring.</td>', 'very nice bold coloring.', '2005-07-02 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499772, 192787, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very clear macro. The highlights in the wings are wonderful.</td>', 'A very clear macro. The highlights in the wings are wonderful.', '2005-07-02 13:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499773, 195062, 10402, '<td valign="top">The center of interest here is the clouds, at least for me. So the lines aren''t really leading but with the power pole nicely frame the subject. Nice composition.</td>', 'The center of interest here is the clouds, at least for me. So the lines aren''t really leading but with the power pole nicely frame the subject. Nice composition.', '2005-07-02 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499774, 196035, 24212, '<td valign="top">A well-captured shot. The rays really lead the eye in.</td>', 'A well-captured shot. The rays really lead the eye in.', '2005-07-02 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499777, 196058, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines, but I don''t find any of them leading me to anything specific. A good, detailed shot, though.</td>', 'Lots of lines, but I don''t find any of them leading me to anything specific. A good, detailed shot, though.', '2005-07-02 13:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499779, 195270, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the strong, bright colours and the simplicity of this. The lines really lead me to the plants.</td>', 'I love the strong, bright colours and the simplicity of this. The lines really lead me to the plants.', '2005-07-02 13:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499783, 196289, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but feel that it could do with a bit more sharpening.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but feel that it could do with a bit more sharpening.', '2005-07-02 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499785, 195436, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the lines in the crops lead directly to the chimney. I do feel, however, that a little sharpening might help.</td>', 'I like the way that the lines in the crops lead directly to the chimney. I do feel, however, that a little sharpening might help.', '2005-07-02 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499786, 195679, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the brightness and the leading line is quite dominant, although I feel that the foreground is perhaps unnecessary and could be cropped off.</td>', 'I like the brightness and the leading line is quite dominant, although I feel that the foreground is perhaps unnecessary and could be cropped off.', '2005-07-02 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499790, 195408, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely capture, although I feel that perhaps some of the foreground could effectively be cropped away.</td>', 'This is a lovely capture, although I feel that perhaps some of the foreground could effectively be cropped away.', '2005-07-02 13:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499791, 196138, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great capture, although I feel that the bright sky behind is a little too strong.</td>', 'A great capture, although I feel that the bright sky behind is a little too strong.', '2005-07-02 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499794, 195824, 27763, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Looks a little heavily processed, but so what?  Still a great photo!  I really like this one a lot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great photo!  Looks a little heavily processed, but so what?  Still a great photo!  I really like this one a lot.  Good luck.', '2005-07-02 13:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499795, 196245, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the background is a little too rough for this shot (additionally, there appears to be a red piece of thread on the lower left) and perhaps the item itself is not as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'I feel that the background is a little too rough for this shot (additionally, there appears to be a red piece of thread on the lower left) and perhaps the item itself is not as sharp as it could be.', '2005-07-02 13:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499796, 196117, 10402, '<td valign="top">The leading lines work with the subject to make a compelling photo. A bit more space at the top would be nice, and it''s a bit too dark.</td>', 'The leading lines work with the subject to make a compelling photo. A bit more space at the top would be nice, and it''s a bit too dark.', '2005-07-02 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499798, 195139, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very inventive shot indeed. The text at the bottom looks a little jagged, though.</td>', 'A very inventive shot indeed. The text at the bottom looks a little jagged, though.', '2005-07-02 13:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499800, 196169, 27763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I like the black and white, too.  One of the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I like the black and white, too.  One of the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far.', '2005-07-02 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499803, 196250, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wow, those lines really lead in. I like the zoom blur (if indeed it was that) here. It really heightens the overall effect.</td>', 'Wow, those lines really lead in. I like the zoom blur (if indeed it was that) here. It really heightens the overall effect.', '2005-07-02 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499806, 195496, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the silhouette of the trees spoils the overall effect somewhat.</td>', 'I think that the silhouette of the trees spoils the overall effect somewhat.', '2005-07-02 13:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499807, 194315, 27763, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The smoke is a nice touch.   Lighting is effective.  No bullet hole in the can, though?</td>', 'Interesting.  The smoke is a nice touch.   Lighting is effective.  No bullet hole in the can, though?', '2005-07-02 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499810, 194113, 24212, '<td valign="top">In this type of shot, I''d perhaps prefer to see a greater depth of field.</td>', 'In this type of shot, I''d perhaps prefer to see a greater depth of field.', '2005-07-02 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499813, 195397, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I really like the colour of the sky here, it looks a little unnatural to me. I do like the composition, however.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I really like the colour of the sky here, it looks a little unnatural to me. I do like the composition, however.', '2005-07-02 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499814, 196082, 24212, '<td valign="top">The subtle glow to this is quite appealing.</td>', 'The subtle glow to this is quite appealing.', '2005-07-02 13:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499815, 196425, 27763, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Thought provoking title, too.</td>', 'Well done.  Thought provoking title, too.', '2005-07-02 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499816, 195793, 24212, '<td valign="top">This gave me a small giggle when I first saw it. Inventive angle and focus spot-on.</td>', 'This gave me a small giggle when I first saw it. Inventive angle and focus spot-on.', '2005-07-02 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499818, 193937, 24212, '<td valign="top">I agree that the lines are leading everywhere, although they do not seem to lead to anything specific.</td>', 'I agree that the lines are leading everywhere, although they do not seem to lead to anything specific.', '2005-07-02 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499819, 196444, 24212, '<td valign="top">The portion of the wing in the bottom left of the frame looks a little soft. I always feel that this type of shot is crying out for all of the wing to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'The portion of the wing in the bottom left of the frame looks a little soft. I always feel that this type of shot is crying out for all of the wing to be in sharp focus.', '2005-07-02 13:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499824, 196372, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines really lead to the subject in this wonderfully sharp, well-lit shot.</td>', 'The lines really lead to the subject in this wonderfully sharp, well-lit shot.', '2005-07-02 13:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499829, 194252, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way that the river leads to the boat, the reflection of which is well-caught. Pleasant colours, not overdone.</td>', 'I really like the way that the river leads to the boat, the reflection of which is well-caught. Pleasant colours, not overdone.', '2005-07-02 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499831, 195763, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, the angle, the lighting on the model and the texture in the wall. The bright patch of grass above tends to draw my attention away from the model.</td>', 'I like the pose, the angle, the lighting on the model and the texture in the wall. The bright patch of grass above tends to draw my attention away from the model.', '2005-07-02 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499835, 196170, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines really lead the eye in. I like the detail and the lighting, which I would guess was pretty difficult to get right.</td>', 'The lines really lead the eye in. I like the detail and the lighting, which I would guess was pretty difficult to get right.', '2005-07-02 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499838, 195096, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great placement of your subjects. Were the ice lollies part of your original plan, or did you have to offer a bribe?</td>', 'Great placement of your subjects. Were the ice lollies part of your original plan, or did you have to offer a bribe?', '2005-07-02 13:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499839, 196387, 24212, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, but I don''t see anything towards which they may be leading me.</td>', 'Strong lines, but I don''t see anything towards which they may be leading me.', '2005-07-02 13:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499842, 195944, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find that the cloth in front of the face is a little too distracting. Good idea, though.</td>', 'I find that the cloth in front of the face is a little too distracting. Good idea, though.', '2005-07-02 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499845, 196366, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines, but I don''t find my self drawn in by any of them. I like the slightly grainy effect.</td>', 'Lots of lines, but I don''t find my self drawn in by any of them. I like the slightly grainy effect.', '2005-07-02 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499849, 195404, 24212, '<td valign="top">There are strong lines leading away from the bottom right corner, but I feel that the platform just seems to be stuck in the middle of nowhere.</td>', 'There are strong lines leading away from the bottom right corner, but I feel that the platform just seems to be stuck in the middle of nowhere.', '2005-07-02 13:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499850, 196439, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2005-07-02 13:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499853, 196161, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the broken lines, but feel that  this could do with an extra touch of sharpening.</td>', 'I like the broken lines, but feel that  this could do with an extra touch of sharpening.', '2005-07-02 13:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499854, 194202, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition and use of selective desaturation.</td>', 'Very clever composition and use of selective desaturation.', '2005-07-02 13:41:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1499855, 196298, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the geometric quality of this shot an I think the shadows work well.</td>', 'I like the geometric quality of this shot an I think the shadows work well.', '2005-07-02 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499861, 195591, 24212, '<td valign="top">The leading lines are strong here, but I feel that it could do with a little extra sharpening and, perhaps, contrast.</td>', 'The leading lines are strong here, but I feel that it could do with a little extra sharpening and, perhaps, contrast.', '2005-07-02 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499862, 196386, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.</td>', 'Very good capture.', '2005-07-02 13:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499865, 196233, 24212, '<td valign="top">They all look pretty impatient.</td>', 'They all look pretty impatient.', '2005-07-02 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499866, 195829, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really feel drawn into the picture by the lines here. I think that the colours are excellent.</td>', 'I really feel drawn into the picture by the lines here. I think that the colours are excellent.', '2005-07-02 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499869, 196421, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but feel that the colours of the pencils are a little too bright.</td>', 'I like the idea, but feel that the colours of the pencils are a little too bright.', '2005-07-02 13:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499872, 196281, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this image is let down, to an extent, by the comparative softness of the tomatoes at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'I feel that this image is let down, to an extent, by the comparative softness of the tomatoes at the bottom of the frame.', '2005-07-02 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499874, 195818, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that black &amp; white was a good idea here.</td>', 'I think that black & white was a good idea here.', '2005-07-02 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499877, 196166, 40130, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2005-07-02 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499878, 195139, 10402, '<td valign="top">Clever, but not really compelling.</td>', 'Clever, but not really compelling.', '2005-07-02 13:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499880, 196399, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines really lead in, but I find this a little too abstract for my tastes.</td>', 'The lines really lead in, but I find this a little too abstract for my tastes.', '2005-07-02 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499885, 194902, 24212, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The lighting is superb, the colours of the petals just stand out enough from the background.</td>', 'Excellent composition. The lighting is superb, the colours of the petals just stand out enough from the background.', '2005-07-02 13:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499886, 195828, 24212, '<td valign="top">What''s not to like here? It''s sharp, contrasty and well composed.</td>', 'What''s not to like here? It''s sharp, contrasty and well composed.', '2005-07-02 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499887, 195710, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but a bit dark. I suppose the low key is supposed to suggest evening, but I still think it should be a bit lighter.</td>', 'Nice photo, but a bit dark. I suppose the low key is supposed to suggest evening, but I still think it should be a bit lighter.', '2005-07-02 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499889, 195774, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the depth of field to be too shallow to create any leading lines.</td>', 'I find the depth of field to be too shallow to create any leading lines.', '2005-07-02 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499890, 195013, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly spotted. All those lines, although I feel that the subject is just a little bit uninteresting.</td>', 'Very cleverly spotted. All those lines, although I feel that the subject is just a little bit uninteresting.', '2005-07-02 13:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
