(1500286, 195589, 23858, '<td valign="top">a bit too extreme whites....but a very nice idea. I''m a big fan of different viewpoint/angle.....which is something this image suffers from not having. Simple task like lowering the camera a few feet down would''ve created a much more interesting angle, in my opinion. 6</td>', 'a bit too extreme whites....but a very nice idea. I''m a big fan of different viewpoint/angle.....which is something this image suffers from not having. Simple task like lowering the camera a few feet down would''ve created a much more interesting angle, in my opinion. 6', '2005-07-02 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500289, 195938, 23858, '<td valign="top">Way too much deadspace in the lower half, doesn´t work as a "negative space" to my eyes - e.g doesn´t improve the image. Too underexposed in my opinion, this is an advanced editing challenge so you should''ve been able to extract some details from those shadows.</td>', 'Way too much deadspace in the lower half, doesn´t work as a "negative space" to my eyes - e.g doesn´t improve the image. Too underexposed in my opinion, this is an advanced editing challenge so you should''ve been able to extract some details from those shadows.', '2005-07-02 18:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500291, 195675, 23858, '<td valign="top">Bit too strong colors for my taste, and the halo/color cast around the trees in the left part does a lot of damage to the complete image. I love the rainbow and the colors there though, and the car/road is in lovely detail/color. 6</td>', 'Bit too strong colors for my taste, and the halo/color cast around the trees in the left part does a lot of damage to the complete image. I love the rainbow and the colors there though, and the car/road is in lovely detail/color. 6', '2005-07-02 18:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
