(1500301, 196372, 23858, '<td valign="top">Love the composition....colors....the leading lines could''ve been more obvious but still do their job.  Still lacks some punch, can´t put my finger on what it is exactly.</td>', 'Love the composition....colors....the leading lines could''ve been more obvious but still do their job.  Still lacks some punch, can´t put my finger on what it is exactly.', '2005-07-02 18:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
