(1500309, 196279, 23858, '<td valign="top">Ouch...this image has been abused by some manic photoshopper ayh? Harsh color treatment completely ruins the image, and it also needs more creativity in my opinion, for example by way of shallow DOF and another angle</td>', 'Ouch...this image has been abused by some manic photoshopper ayh? Harsh color treatment completely ruins the image, and it also needs more creativity in my opinion, for example by way of shallow DOF and another angle', '2005-07-02 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
