(1501270, 195053, 35513, '<td valign="top">Go ahead and use the full size allowed if you can for challenges.  I think you''ll find that you receive higher scores.  Lots of lines in this photo!  Good eye and great angle for this shot.  Lines definitely lead your eye to the center of the triangle.</td>', 'Go ahead and use the full size allowed if you can for challenges.  I think you''ll find that you receive higher scores.  Lots of lines in this photo!  Good eye and great angle for this shot.  Lines definitely lead your eye to the center of the triangle.', '2005-07-03 04:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
