(1501279, 196298, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, colors and lighting.  I think it might be a little stronger if the curve of the wall lead to a bench, or a particularly colorful group of flowers, or perhaps a person.  But we can''t always put these things where we want them :-)  Good angle on the curve, it definitely causes the eye to travel across the photo.</td>', 'Good clarity, colors and lighting.  I think it might be a little stronger if the curve of the wall lead to a bench, or a particularly colorful group of flowers, or perhaps a person.  But we can''t always put these things where we want them :-)  Good angle on the curve, it definitely causes the eye to travel across the photo.', '2005-07-03 04:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501281, 192814, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful shot with beautifully clear detail.</td>', 'Nice colorful shot with beautifully clear detail.', '2005-07-03 04:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
