(1501409, 196208, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the idea but it seems just a bit out of focus down the line, The low light probably didn''t help much but it is a nice shot.</td>', 'Love the idea but it seems just a bit out of focus down the line, The low light probably didn''t help much but it is a nice shot.', '2005-07-03 08:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
