(1501419, 195828, 39106, '<td valign="top">Great idea,  I think it will score well</td>', 'Great idea,  I think it will score well', '2005-07-03 09:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501429, 194252, 27763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful overall composition.  The boat in the foreground adds so much to this image.  I love the boat''s lines, lighting, colors, the reflection in the water, and  the tonal gradation of blue from the bow to the stern.  As far as leading lines goes, I do feel that the "shoreline"  leads my eye *away* from the boat, rather than *towards* it, but I suppose that it leads me into the rest of the picture.  Is this bear_music? If not, I apologize.</td>', 'Beautiful overall composition.  The boat in the foreground adds so much to this image.  I love the boat''s lines, lighting, colors, the reflection in the water, and  the tonal gradation of blue from the bow to the stern.  As far as leading lines goes, I do feel that the "shoreline"  leads my eye *away* from the boat, rather than *towards* it, but I suppose that it leads me into the rest of the picture.  Is this bear_music? If not, I apologize.', '2005-07-03 09:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501430, 193157, 31175, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-07-03 09:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501441, 196170, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome lines that lead your eye into the shot.  Great lighting and textures.  What subway is this?  I''ve never been in one before, but when ya see them on TV or movies they don''t look cool like this.  Now the problem  Your lines lead deep into the shot and draw you directly to...  a bench and a couple of service doors.  Anticlimatic to say the least.<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome lines that lead your eye into the shot.  Great lighting and textures.  What subway is this?  I''ve never been in one before, but when ya see them on TV or movies they don''t look cool like this.  Now the problem  Your lines lead deep into the shot and draw you directly to...  a bench and a couple of service doors.  Anticlimatic to say the least.TC', '2005-07-03 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501442, 196109, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice cool tones.  Nice lines.  You lack a focal point though.  No where for your eye to rest...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice cool tones.  Nice lines.  You lack a focal point though.  No where for your eye to rest...TC', '2005-07-03 10:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501443, 196212, 33672, '<td valign="top">its a great idea and I like the reflection. Hpwever, the leading lines get lost in the lighting that makes the photo very busy.</td>', 'its a great idea and I like the reflection. Hpwever, the leading lines get lost in the lighting that makes the photo very busy.', '2005-07-03 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501444, 196073, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I wonder if it would''ve benefitted from a deeper DOF.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I wonder if it would''ve benefitted from a deeper DOF.', '2005-07-03 10:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501445, 196108, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Great capture.  It''s kinda funny though.  Your border caught my eye right away but it''s the exact opposite of the one that I''ve used so many times with success.  (mine are black with a lite line running through it...)  Don''t know why this is.  Not a complaint with this treatment.  Just an observation!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Great capture.  It''s kinda funny though.  Your border caught my eye right away but it''s the exact opposite of the one that I''ve used so many times with success.  (mine are black with a lite line running through it...)  Don''t know why this is.  Not a complaint with this treatment.  Just an observation!TC', '2005-07-03 10:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501447, 195270, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great colors and comp! It seems a little over sharpened and saturated or is it me. The subtle lines make this a great shot.</td>', 'Great colors and comp! It seems a little over sharpened and saturated or is it me. The subtle lines make this a great shot.', '2005-07-03 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501449, 196093, 9906, '<td valign="top">You mean those things can be left in the photo?  Just kidding.  This shot works nicely for the challenge.  To bad ya didn''t have an even more dramatic sky...<br/>TC</td>', 'You mean those things can be left in the photo?  Just kidding.  This shot works nicely for the challenge.  To bad ya didn''t have an even more dramatic sky...TC', '2005-07-03 10:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501452, 196400, 9906, '<td valign="top">A tad bit busy for my taste.  Maybe a tighter zoom to block out un-needed elements would make it more effective.  I''m not sure what the selective desat is supposed to say here.  At 640 by xxx  it''s not very effective.  Might work at 8x10 though.<br/>TC</td>', 'A tad bit busy for my taste.  Maybe a tighter zoom to block out un-needed elements would make it more effective.  I''m not sure what the selective desat is supposed to say here.  At 640 by xxx  it''s not very effective.  Might work at 8x10 though.TC', '2005-07-03 10:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501453, 194142, 9906, '<td valign="top">I wanna see the water...  With this choice of DOF, I find myself wanting...<br/>TC</td>', 'I wanna see the water...  With this choice of DOF, I find myself wanting...TC', '2005-07-03 10:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501468, 196416, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute snap!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute snap!TC', '2005-07-03 10:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501475, 196177, 25742, '<td valign="top">very nice, good setup and all the factors are there, but for one tiny nag: what leading lines? The only strong leading lines in this photo are the tracks and they are more or less blocked by the girls. To make them a more important part I''d position the girls further away, walking away, on the left track, or to the left of the track, just well enough in focus so you can see what they are and what they are doing. Icing on the cake woud be a train coming around a bend in the tracks.<br/>I really like this photo, but don''t see it fitting well enough into the challenge.<br/>You probably already got a lot of comments of this kind, and I predict a 5.5-6 score and quite a few favs. Good luck.</td>', 'very nice, good setup and all the factors are there, but for one tiny nag: what leading lines? The only strong leading lines in this photo are the tracks and they are more or less blocked by the girls. To make them a more important part I''d position the girls further away, walking away, on the left track, or to the left of the track, just well enough in focus so you can see what they are and what they are doing. Icing on the cake woud be a train coming around a bend in the tracks.I really like this photo, but don''t see it fitting well enough into the challenge.You probably already got a lot of comments of this kind, and I predict a 5.5-6 score and quite a few favs. Good luck.', '2005-07-03 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501478, 195143, 25742, '<td valign="top">focus could be sharper</td>', 'focus could be sharper', '2005-07-03 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501479, 196402, 25742, '<td valign="top">the shadows are too strong for my tastes</td>', 'the shadows are too strong for my tastes', '2005-07-03 10:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
