(1501512, 194321, 33392, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of guitar entries in this challenge - this was my favorite.  The shadowing underneath the guitar is a little distracting though.<br/> <br/>Curious - did you also try this shot with the focal point out near the nut?  I don''t know if it would have been more or less effective.  Again, just curious.</td>', 'There were a lot of guitar entries in this challenge - this was my favorite.  The shadowing underneath the guitar is a little distracting though. Curious - did you also try this shot with the focal point out near the nut?  I don''t know if it would have been more or less effective.  Again, just curious.', '2005-07-03 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501513, 196372, 32345, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture but I don''t really see any leading lines.</td>', 'This is a nice picture but I don''t really see any leading lines.', '2005-07-03 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501514, 196250, 32997, '<td valign="top">Very alive..well done..love the blurry foreground and placement of the person...creative and interesting.</td>', 'Very alive..well done..love the blurry foreground and placement of the person...creative and interesting.', '2005-07-03 11:13:22.000000', NULL, 1);
