(1501956, 195945, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love the lines..the colours..red leading to red..just wonderful..this shot makes me feel like I am just taking in a moment, and staying far enough away so as not to interfere...nice emotive.</td>', 'I love the lines..the colours..red leading to red..just wonderful..this shot makes me feel like I am just taking in a moment, and staying far enough away so as not to interfere...nice emotive.', '2005-07-03 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
