(1501982, 195793, 8377, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I really like the high dof, so that the one book? is in focus, and everything else is not. Good colors, and I like the composition. It''s a bit out of the box, not your typical landscape leading lines photo, and I really like the uniqueness of this photo.</td>', 'Very nice, I really like the high dof, so that the one book? is in focus, and everything else is not. Good colors, and I like the composition. It''s a bit out of the box, not your typical landscape leading lines photo, and I really like the uniqueness of this photo.', '2005-07-03 15:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
