(1502031, 195270, 2764, '<td valign="top">they look like little aliens who just walked up a hill on mars - very personable weeds you''ve got.  You also have my favorite image in the challenge!  Perfect is all I can say. 10</td>', 'they look like little aliens who just walked up a hill on mars - very personable weeds you''ve got.  You also have my favorite image in the challenge!  Perfect is all I can say. 10', '2005-07-03 16:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
