(1502043, 196264, 31133, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse and the sky are really good - nice sharpness and beautiful colors. Unfortunately, I think the foreground colors look a little drab (especially compared to that beauty in the back). I like the "leading line" aspect of the stream drawing the viewer back and up towards the lighthouse.</td>', 'The lighthouse and the sky are really good - nice sharpness and beautiful colors. Unfortunately, I think the foreground colors look a little drab (especially compared to that beauty in the back). I like the "leading line" aspect of the stream drawing the viewer back and up towards the lighthouse.', '2005-07-03 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502046, 196122, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a perfect title. Can''t wait to see where this is - I''m guessing Austria or norther Italy. I like the colors and the composition both. It''s nice to see the blue of the water on the right to break up all that green a little. The road is a good leading line, too (but what a sharp corner down there at the bottom right of the frame!)</td>', 'What a perfect title. Can''t wait to see where this is - I''m guessing Austria or norther Italy. I like the colors and the composition both. It''s nice to see the blue of the water on the right to break up all that green a little. The road is a good leading line, too (but what a sharp corner down there at the bottom right of the frame!)', '2005-07-03 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502048, 193047, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is so cool - it''s very ordinary on the surface, but the longer I look, the compositional interest I see. I like the way the road edge leads my eye up to the fog, and then the subtle colors of the house. The tree to the left of the house really adds to this shot, in my opinion. Even though the softness compliments the fog, I''d still like to see the image sharpened a bit more. Good job.</td>', 'This is so cool - it''s very ordinary on the surface, but the longer I look, the compositional interest I see. I like the way the road edge leads my eye up to the fog, and then the subtle colors of the house. The tree to the left of the house really adds to this shot, in my opinion. Even though the softness compliments the fog, I''d still like to see the image sharpened a bit more. Good job.', '2005-07-03 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502051, 196108, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! So clean and a very good lesson in composition for me. I love how the white line at the right shoulder stands out to emphasize the line. If it were mine, I probably would have gone with color, but when I see this, I am certain that the black and white is the best for this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful!! So clean and a very good lesson in composition for me. I love how the white line at the right shoulder stands out to emphasize the line. If it were mine, I probably would have gone with color, but when I see this, I am certain that the black and white is the best for this shot.', '2005-07-03 16:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502053, 193937, 31133, '<td valign="top">The lines are leading everywhere and nowhere both. I like the black and white here a lot. The image could use a touch more sharpening, in my (very amateurish :-) opinion. All the different angles and shapes make this a very interesting entry.</td>', 'The lines are leading everywhere and nowhere both. I like the black and white here a lot. The image could use a touch more sharpening, in my (very amateurish :-) opinion. All the different angles and shapes make this a very interesting entry.', '2005-07-03 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502056, 196329, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly. I''d like to see the shot rotated a little maybe, because it looks to me tilted toward the left. The black and white is nice, could use a touch more sharpening. What a beautiful bridge!</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly. I''d like to see the shot rotated a little maybe, because it looks to me tilted toward the left. The black and white is nice, could use a touch more sharpening. What a beautiful bridge!', '2005-07-03 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502057, 196250, 31133, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The gate looks like it is moving. The guy looks like he''s trying to stop it. I''d like to see just a touch more of the guy, that is, a tad bit less severe cropping over there. All in all, this is one of my faves so far. Makes me dizzy and I like it.</td>', 'Awesome! The gate looks like it is moving. The guy looks like he''s trying to stop it. I''d like to see just a touch more of the guy, that is, a tad bit less severe cropping over there. All in all, this is one of my faves so far. Makes me dizzy and I like it.', '2005-07-03 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502063, 194252, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is very, very beautiful. I love the soft focus, but the boat seems perfectly sharp. The line leads my eye from the background to the foreground, which is the opposite from most entries I''ve seen in this challenge. I think the position of the boat in the frame is perfect.</td>', 'This is very, very beautiful. I love the soft focus, but the boat seems perfectly sharp. The line leads my eye from the background to the foreground, which is the opposite from most entries I''ve seen in this challenge. I think the position of the boat in the frame is perfect.', '2005-07-03 16:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502064, 196084, 31133, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful.</td>', 'Creative and colorful.', '2005-07-03 16:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502067, 195832, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The color streaks (from processing?) in the left foreground are distracting, but everything else is perfect. Nice job.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The color streaks (from processing?) in the left foreground are distracting, but everything else is perfect. Nice job.', '2005-07-03 16:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502089, 196205, 27605, '<td valign="top">Feel the need to leave a comment since I voted 3 on this photo.  I don''t understand the photo, I guess.  I see feathers, a wire, and the other two white lines, along with the wispy dark smudges.   But then again, I''m pretty much a stick-in-the-mud when it comes to originality!  Good luck.</td>', 'Feel the need to leave a comment since I voted 3 on this photo.  I don''t understand the photo, I guess.  I see feathers, a wire, and the other two white lines, along with the wispy dark smudges.   But then again, I''m pretty much a stick-in-the-mud when it comes to originality!  Good luck.', '2005-07-03 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
