(1502096, 195679, 25742, '<td valign="top">the shadows in the FG are distracting. If possible go 2-3 steps forward, into the water (nobody said that photography was a dry sport) and lower, for example to about the same height as the pier. Maybe also  to the otherside of the pier to get rid of the shadow under it, but I don''t know if the boathouse will be as prominent then. This is in most respects a good shot, but could be better. /7</td>', 'the shadows in the FG are distracting. If possible go 2-3 steps forward, into the water (nobody said that photography was a dry sport) and lower, for example to about the same height as the pier. Maybe also  to the otherside of the pier to get rid of the shadow under it, but I don''t know if the boathouse will be as prominent then. This is in most respects a good shot, but could be better. /7', '2005-07-03 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
