(1502659, 196384, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, good DOF. I think if you had a subject (such as a spider or bug) on the end of the leaf, this image would be much more interesting. Even as is, it is very cool!</td>', 'Nice macro shot, good DOF. I think if you had a subject (such as a spider or bug) on the end of the leaf, this image would be much more interesting. Even as is, it is very cool!', '2005-07-03 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502668, 196326, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great leading line because while it leads to the subject it also forms a dichotomy bewteen the rich foreground and the soft and surreal background. Would have loved this is all b/w. A great image, regardless. <br/></td>', 'A great leading line because while it leads to the subject it also forms a dichotomy bewteen the rich foreground and the soft and surreal background. Would have loved this is all b/w. A great image, regardless. ', '2005-07-03 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502676, 194991, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the pathway to show motion towards the belltower. Maybe if you tried a bit lower angle (close to ground), the lines would stand out better. The tower also seems to be tilting to the right a bit, a small rotation would fix that. The trees also look oversharpened to me. The brightness on the stone on the lower right side might be better if it weren''t in the image. I like the image, but I think it could use a few improvements, but great idea. PM me if you have any questions.</td>', 'Nice use of the pathway to show motion towards the belltower. Maybe if you tried a bit lower angle (close to ground), the lines would stand out better. The tower also seems to be tilting to the right a bit, a small rotation would fix that. The trees also look oversharpened to me. The brightness on the stone on the lower right side might be better if it weren''t in the image. I like the image, but I think it could use a few improvements, but great idea. PM me if you have any questions.', '2005-07-03 23:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502677, 196170, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen and composed.<br/>Perhaps needs a very slight CCW rotation to ease the eye. (minor technicality..)</td>', 'Very nicely seen and composed.Perhaps needs a very slight CCW rotation to ease the eye. (minor technicality..)', '2005-07-03 23:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
