(1502903, 196102, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very very neat. I didn''t see this in voting week but I would have wished it a ribbon had I :). Congrats on such a nice shot and the ribbon!</td>', 'Very very neat. I didn''t see this in voting week but I would have wished it a ribbon had I :). Congrats on such a nice shot and the ribbon!', '2005-07-04 01:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502908, 196385, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hey Laurie, I knew this had to be you!  I don''t know what it''s doing down in the 80th place, but I thought it was great.  I wondered if, being a wedding shot, might have skewed my perspective a little... still, I loved how the lines from the chairs, the petals, even the "lighting" appeared to guide me right straight in to the couple and then "bam" there they were.  Awesome shot!</td>', 'Hey Laurie, I knew this had to be you!  I don''t know what it''s doing down in the 80th place, but I thought it was great.  I wondered if, being a wedding shot, might have skewed my perspective a little... still, I loved how the lines from the chairs, the petals, even the "lighting" appeared to guide me right straight in to the couple and then "bam" there they were.  Awesome shot!', '2005-07-04 01:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502911, 193157, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice one slip/</td>', 'Nice one slip/', '2005-07-04 01:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
