(1502914, 196251, 30222, '<td valign="top">i admit reading the comments and looking at this image again the leading lines are not that strong<br/>here this outtake wich has stronger leading lines but is less of an image is why i did not sent it<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-24 16:00:32.</i></td>', 'i admit reading the comments and looking at this image again the leading lines are not that stronghere this outtake wich has stronger leading lines but is less of an image is why i did not sent it', '2005-07-04 01:18:35.000000', '2005-11-24 16:00:32.000000', 0),
(1502920, 192712, 5286, '<td valign="top">I knew this was you, isn''t this the same staircase you''ve used before to great effect in Minimalism? Congrats on a great shot and the top ten finish :) <br/></td>', 'I knew this was you, isn''t this the same staircase you''ve used before to great effect in Minimalism? Congrats on a great shot and the top ten finish :) ', '2005-07-04 01:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502922, 195760, 24454, '<td valign="top">Zemm, this is absolutely beautiful!   I can''t believe what an eye for photograpny you have, and a talent for execution.   The leading lines in this are so striking, taking you right past that beautiful lighthouse.<br/> <br/>You have so much talent!   Keep up the excellent work!<br/> <br/>SandyP</td>', 'Zemm, this is absolutely beautiful!   I can''t believe what an eye for photograpny you have, and a talent for execution.   The leading lines in this are so striking, taking you right past that beautiful lighthouse. You have so much talent!   Keep up the excellent work! SandyP', '2005-07-04 01:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502930, 196219, 5286, '<td valign="top">Loved this one when I saw it in voting week! You seem to be on a roll this week, one ribbon and one top ten :) Excellent shot, and perfect for the challenge..congratulations!</td>', 'Loved this one when I saw it in voting week! You seem to be on a roll this week, one ribbon and one top ten :) Excellent shot, and perfect for the challenge..congratulations!', '2005-07-04 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502940, 196222, 34247, '<td valign="top">As with some others of your images, I feel this was hard done by the voters. 33 out of 274 isn''t much of a reason to complain, but I personally feel that your absolute handle of the techniques, and your willingness to go beyond everyday, common and trite stock images are to be envied, and unfortunately missed by many here.<br/>Looking forward to seeing more of your images, and hoping they will continue to help me push my own thinking along.<br/></td>', 'As with some others of your images, I feel this was hard done by the voters. 33 out of 274 isn''t much of a reason to complain, but I personally feel that your absolute handle of the techniques, and your willingness to go beyond everyday, common and trite stock images are to be envied, and unfortunately missed by many here.Looking forward to seeing more of your images, and hoping they will continue to help me push my own thinking along.', '2005-07-04 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502960, 196426, 11738, '<td valign="top">Please tell us how you managed such a black background with everything else so well lit.</td>', 'Please tell us how you managed such a black background with everything else so well lit.', '2005-07-04 01:26:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502966, 196426, 23456, '<td valign="top">Well deserved, composition perfect !</td>', 'Well deserved, composition perfect !', '2005-07-04 01:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502970, 196426, 39265, '<td valign="top">Congrats! I don''t remember seeing this photo either in the challenge. However, you deserve the blue! Great Shot! :)</td>', 'Congrats! I don''t remember seeing this photo either in the challenge. However, you deserve the blue! Great Shot! :)', '2005-07-04 01:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502984, 195820, 33379, '<td valign="top">yep didnt think people would get it, oh well better luck next time!</td>', 'yep didnt think people would get it, oh well better luck next time!', '2005-07-04 01:30:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502991, 195954, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great finish Brian!   I knew this would do well.  It''s a beautiful picture!</td>', 'Great finish Brian!   I knew this would do well.  It''s a beautiful picture!', '2005-07-04 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502994, 196364, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Damned beach!" jejeje<br/> <br/>Really nice shot, zoomy. BTW, when I built boats, I used the abbreviation AMDG: Ad Majorem Dei Gloriam, "To the greater glory of God"  Is not your SDG properly translated "For God''s glory alone (or only)?"<br/> <br/>R.</td>', '"Damned beach!" jejeje Really nice shot, zoomy. BTW, when I built boats, I used the abbreviation AMDG: Ad Majorem Dei Gloriam, "To the greater glory of God"  Is not your SDG properly translated "For God''s glory alone (or only)?" R.', '2005-07-04 01:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1503011, 194252, 30861, '<td valign="top">Yes, this was the idea for sure. I knew the challenge would be FULL of lines leading TO subjects, but I actually believe leading lines are most commonly used to lead the eye FROM a subject and INTO (and possibly out of) the picture; especially in landscape photographny, where a foreground subject + leading lines take you into the landscape proper.<br/> <br/>Thanks, all, for voting and commenting. Fun shoot.</td>', 'Yes, this was the idea for sure. I knew the challenge would be FULL of lines leading TO subjects, but I actually believe leading lines are most commonly used to lead the eye FROM a subject and INTO (and possibly out of) the picture; especially in landscape photographny, where a foreground subject + leading lines take you into the landscape proper. Thanks, all, for voting and commenting. Fun shoot.', '2005-07-04 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1503016, 196312, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> Marbo? </i></td></tr></table>Ah, guess not, just that he''s done many of these kind of shots lately. Great job, btw =).</td>', 'Originally posted by Zoomdak: Marbo? Ah, guess not, just that he''s done many of these kind of shots lately. Great job, btw =).', '2005-07-04 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1503018, 196169, 26849, '<td valign="top">One persons "pesky branch" is another persons leading line. I like this interesting compostion of multiple leading lines. Those branches push the eye back to the girl in my opinion.</td>', 'One persons "pesky branch" is another persons leading line. I like this interesting compostion of multiple leading lines. Those branches push the eye back to the girl in my opinion.', '2005-07-04 01:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
