(1503592, 196073, 37893, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by northrop3:</b></div><hr/><i> easily my favorite from this challenge.  The spotlighting is interesting.  Is this an affect you applied or natural?  I would love to see a full view of this to see how this component fits into an entire bridge.  8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for all the great comments.  I didn''t have to do much except crop the image. Here is the <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=199751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">original</a> file. Cropping is definitely a photographer''s best friend.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-04 02:44:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by northrop3: easily my favorite from this challenge.  The spotlighting is interesting.  Is this an affect you applied or natural?  I would love to see a full view of this to see how this component fits into an entire bridge.  8.   Thanks everyone for all the great comments.  I didn''t have to do much except crop the image. Here is the original file. Cropping is definitely a photographer''s best friend.', '2005-07-04 03:42:59.000000', '2005-07-04 03:44:52.000000', 0),
