(1503680, 196210, 18450, '<td valign="top">Hey there Peter.......Congrats on your 4th place with this stunning image! The colours capture your eye at first, but it''s the shapes, textures, depth, perspective...there''s so much more to it, it''s really interesting!! Have to add this one to my favs!</td>', 'Hey there Peter.......Congrats on your 4th place with this stunning image! The colours capture your eye at first, but it''s the shapes, textures, depth, perspective...there''s so much more to it, it''s really interesting!! Have to add this one to my favs!', '2005-07-04 04:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
