(1507576, 196102, 36981, '<td valign="top">So sorry about the DQ!  Regardless of whether you fit the editing rules, I repeat my comment made while voting: this still is my favorite picture in the challenge.  I love everything about it.  Please post in your portfolio so that I can mark it as a favorite!</td>', 'So sorry about the DQ!  Regardless of whether you fit the editing rules, I repeat my comment made while voting: this still is my favorite picture in the challenge.  I love everything about it.  Please post in your portfolio so that I can mark it as a favorite!', '2005-07-05 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
