(1507761, 196102, 31403, '<td valign="top">Sorry David, I do know how you must feel.  I had a fourth place DQ''d and felt the same things I''ve seen you expressing in the forums.  So happy to have your work accepted and then to have it yanked out from underneath you is a tough rollercoaster to ride.<br/> <br/>I continue to wonder what to do with DPC feedback.  I always feel better after a DQ to go sell the print as many times, for as much as I can extract, as possible.  This has indeed been my salve for my Ansel Adams wounds, and one other.<br/> <br/>My point is, you created a great photo, you thought you were within the guidelines (so do I) and you won critical acclaim from your peers.  I''ve appreciated your openess and candor too.  Congrats on a fine artistic achievement, and a great finish.  You''ve still got the ribbon in my book - for what that''s worth.<br/> <br/>(edited for clarity)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-05 11:02:15.</i></td>', 'Sorry David, I do know how you must feel.  I had a fourth place DQ''d and felt the same things I''ve seen you expressing in the forums.  So happy to have your work accepted and then to have it yanked out from underneath you is a tough rollercoaster to ride. I continue to wonder what to do with DPC feedback.  I always feel better after a DQ to go sell the print as many times, for as much as I can extract, as possible.  This has indeed been my salve for my Ansel Adams wounds, and one other. My point is, you created a great photo, you thought you were within the guidelines (so do I) and you won critical acclaim from your peers.  I''ve appreciated your openess and candor too.  Congrats on a fine artistic achievement, and a great finish.  You''ve still got the ribbon in my book - for what that''s worth. (edited for clarity)', '2005-07-05 11:59:25.000000', '2005-07-05 12:02:15.000000', 0),
(1507772, 196102, 12253, '<td valign="top">Sorry to see this DQ''d.  It''s wonderful as I said before.<br/> <br/>I know the DQ still stings, but if you would be so kind as to post the original pre-editing, we can all learn from this what the site council thinks is too much editing.</td>', 'Sorry to see this DQ''d.  It''s wonderful as I said before. I know the DQ still stings, but if you would be so kind as to post the original pre-editing, we can all learn from this what the site council thinks is too much editing.', '2005-07-05 12:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507803, 196108, 37083, '<td valign="top">This is a Beautiful Pic!!! I really like it. Well done! :)</td>', 'This is a Beautiful Pic!!! I really like it. Well done! :)', '2005-07-05 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507854, 196208, 23653, '<td valign="top">I like it as it is, I think if there was a train it would take a way from the photo.  The black hole tunnel works very well. Nice photo.<br/> <br/>Ty</td>', 'I like it as it is, I think if there was a train it would take a way from the photo.  The black hole tunnel works very well. Nice photo. Ty', '2005-07-05 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507911, 192712, 27845, '<td valign="top">How come this looks familiar? :)<br/>I was admiring your shot ''Repetition with variations for small child'' not too long ago. Assuming this is the place, I like how you created two photographs that look stunningly different even though they contain the same elements.<br/>A stunning image which will hopefully feel cozy next to it''s ''sister'' in my favourites.</td>', 'How come this looks familiar? :)I was admiring your shot ''Repetition with variations for small child'' not too long ago. Assuming this is the place, I like how you created two photographs that look stunningly different even though they contain the same elements.A stunning image which will hopefully feel cozy next to it''s ''sister'' in my favourites.', '2005-07-05 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507913, 195282, 37529, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the helpful and kind comments.  It would have helped if there some barnyard animal at the end of the fence but it just didn''t happen.  It was fun taking the picture though.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the helpful and kind comments.  It would have helped if there some barnyard animal at the end of the fence but it just didn''t happen.  It was fun taking the picture though.', '2005-07-05 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507937, 196210, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Nice work. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2005-07-05 13:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1507957, 195589, 39265, '<td valign="top">I think you should have done better in the ratings. I love it.</td>', 'I think you should have done better in the ratings. I love it.', '2005-07-05 13:50:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1508090, 192708, 27735, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments. Yep, it''s definitely over-sharpened. I did it on purpose, though, because I liked the effect.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments. Yep, it''s definitely over-sharpened. I did it on purpose, though, because I liked the effect.', '2005-07-05 14:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
